- Nắm vững kiến thức nền tảng về lập trình hướng đối tượng (OOP).', 15000000, 10000000, 'CLOSED', 'New Java Software Engineer', '2026-08-10 17:00:53.727140', 4, 0, 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dimvyno0z/image/upload/v1785559019/my_app/images/doiepwcat9akjog0purf.png', 'Viettel Soft'),
        (58, 0, '- Premium healthcare package plus annual medical check-up.
- Free daily lunch served at the company cafeteria and free kindergarten for employee''s kids.
- Flexible working hours, no OT culture, work-life balance emphasis.
