        (52, 1, 'OPSWAT is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to providing an environment where equal employment opportunities are extended to all employees and applicants, free of discrimination and harassment of any type. All employment decisions are based on individual qualifications, job requirements, and business needs without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other category protected by federal, state, or local laws.', '2026-08-10 14:44:18.235399', 'VND', '2026-08-31 07:41:00.000000', null, 'OPSWAT, a global leader in IT, OT, and ICS critical infrastructure cybersecurity, delivers an end-to-end platform that gives public and private sector organizations and enterprises the critical advantage needed to protect their complex networks, secure their devices, and ensure compliance. Over the last 20 years our commitment to innovative technology has earned the trust of more than 1,700 organizations, governments, and institutions globally, solidifying our role in protecting the world’s critical infrastructure and securing our way of life.', false, 'INTERN', 'Currently pursuing or recently completed a Bachelor''s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related technical field
Basic understanding of object-oriented programming and data structures/algorithms
Curiosity about or prior exposure to AI coding assistants (e.g., ChatGPT, Copilot, Claude) 
Strong problem-solving skills and eagerness to learn a large, real-world codebase
Good communication skills in English, spoken and written
Self-motivated, reliable, and comfortable asking questions in a fast-paced, team-oriented environment', 2000000, 1000000, 'OPEN', 'Software Engineer Intern ', '2026-08-10 16:37:38.432571', 9, 0, 'https://res.cloudinary.com/dimvyno0z/image/upload/v1786379848/my_app/images/vr3i630pm7qppmyyozvm.png', 'LG Software'),
        (42, 0, 'Competitive salary package and performance bonus.
