Participate in all stages of agile product development life cycle with Scrum', false, 'FRESHER', 'At least 1 year of internship experience in Java Engineering at a large corporation or enterprise company
Experience in Messaging Queues such as Kafka, RabbitMQ, MQTT or ActiveMQ is a big plus
