        (44, 1, '- Competitive salary package with 13th-month bonus and annual performance review.
- Sponsorship for AWS & Oracle Java Professional Certifications.
- Premium Health Insurance package (PVI/Bao Viet) and annual company retreat.
- Modern working environment with high-spec equipment and flexible working hours.', '2026-07-28 14:24:44.490494', 'VND', '2026-08-25 03:00:00.000000', null, 'We are looking for a passionate Junior Java Backend Developer to join our core engineering team. You will participate in building scalable RESTful APIs, optimizing database queries, and integrating microservices for our AI-driven platform.', false, 'JUNIOR', '- Strong foundation in Core Java (Java 17+ / 21) and Object-Oriented Programming (OOP).
