imes, theaters, promotions, user accounts, and points accumulation. Authorization & Authentication (Cookie Authentication). Designed the entire database and processing flow architecture for the modules. Actively learned and mastered all modules, acted as a connection point between sections, divided tasks and guided the team to implement code according to the design. Performed work under the supervision of the mentor, ensuring project progress and quality."}]}', '{"basic_info": {"job_title": "Java Backend Developer", "industry_domain": "Công nghệ thông tin", "seniority_level": "Junior"}, "competencies": {"hard_skills": ["Java", "Spring Boot", "REST API", "SQL"], "soft_skills": ["Giao tiếp", "Giải quyết vấn đề"], "tools_and_platforms": ["Docker", "Git"]}, "responsibilities": []}', null, '{"domain": "IT", "language": "VI", "difficulty": "FRESHER_BASIC", "interview_mode": "STANDARD_MOCK", "duration_minutes": 30}', null),
        (27, null, 12, null, '2026-04-17 15:43:09.257164', '2026-04-17 15:43:11.494219', 'IT', 'IN_PROGRESS', 'STANDARD_MOCK', null, '5ebaa053-0580-45af-949d-6625742949bb', '{"blueprint": [{"questions": [{"order": 1, "rag_keyword": null, "question_text": "Chào Thu Hồng, rất vui được gặp bạn hôm nay. Bạn có thể giới thiệu ngắn gọn về bản thân và chia sẻ điều gì khiến bạn hứng thú với vị trí Java Software Engineer không?", "question_type": "CORE"}], "phase_name": "Chào hỏi", "duration_minutes": 2}, {"questions": [{"order": 2, "rag_keyword": "redis_use_case", "question_text": "Trong dự án AI Mock Interview Platform, bạn đã sử dụng Redis để làm gì? Hãy giải thích ngắn gọn về vai trò của Redis trong kiến trúc hệ thống này.", "question_type": "CORE"}, {"order": 3, "rag_keyword": "rag_implementation", "question_text": "Bạn có thể mô tả cách RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) được sử dụng trong dự án này không? Cụ thể, dữ liệu được lấy từ PostgreSQL và Gemini/Gemma như thế nào?", "question_type": "CORE"}, {"order": 4, "rag_keyword": "spring_boot_features", "question_text": "Bạn đã sử dụng Spring Boot trong dự án này như thế nào? Hãy cho biết một vài tính năng của Spring Boot mà bạn đã sử dụng.", "question_type": "FOLLOW_UP"}], "phase_name": "Deep-dive Dự án 1: AI Mock Interview Platform", "duration_minutes": 9}, {"questions": [{"order": 5, "rag_keyword": "cloudflare_tunnel_zero_trust", "question_text": "Bạn đã sử dụng Cloudflare Tunnel (Zero Trust) để làm gì trong dự án Personal Home Lab Server? Ưu điểm của việc sử dụng Cloudflare Tunnel là gì?", "question_type": "CORE"}, {"order": 6, "rag_keyword": "github_actions_watchtower_cicd", "question_text": "Bạn có thể giải thích về quy trình CI/CD pull-based mà bạn đã xây dựng sử dụng GitHub Actions và Watchtower không?", "question_type": "CORE"}], "phase_name": "Deep-dive Dự án 2: Personal Home Lab Server", "duration_minutes": 4}, {"questions": [{"order": 7, "rag_keyword": "java_list_vs_set", "question_text": "Trong Java, `List` và `Set` khác nhau ở điểm nào? Khi nào bạn nên sử dụng `List` thay vì `Set`?", "question_type": "CORE"}, {"order": 8, "rag_keyword": "spring_autowired_annotation", "question_text": "Annotation `@Autowired` trong Spring Framework có tác dụng gì?", "question_type": "CORE"}, {"order": 9, "rag_keyword": "spring_dependency_injection", "question_text": "Bạn hiểu thế nào về Dependency Injection (DI) trong Spring? DI giúp ích gì cho việc phát triển ứng dụng?", "question_type": "CORE"}, {"order": 10, "rag_keyword": "restful_api_concept", "question_text": "Bạn có thể giải thích ngắn gọn về khái niệm RESTful API?", "question_type": "CORE"}], "phase_name": "Kiến thức Core: Java & Spring", "duration_minutes": 10}, {"questions": [{"order": 11, "rag_keyword": null, "question_text": "Bạn có câu hỏi nào dành cho tôi không?", "question_type": "CORE"}], "phase_name": "Kết thúc", "duration_minutes": 5}], "strategy_analysis": "Chiến thuật phỏng vấn theo mode `STANDARD_MOCK` và độ khó `FRESHER_BASIC`. Tập trung vào hỏi sâu về dự án trong CV (40%) và kiến thức nền tảng Java/Spring (50%). Các câu hỏi được thiết kế để đánh giá kiến thức cơ bản và khả năng ứng dụng của ứng viên."}', '{"id": 4, "user": {"id": 12, "name": "Thu Hồng", "role": "USER", "cvUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dimvyno0z/image/upload/v1776440528/my_app/docs/0b585ed3-8bf4-42d0-a42d-89494b3b0b54.pdf", "email": "hong2@gmail.com", "major": "CNTT", "isActive": true, "password": "12345", "avatarUrl": null, "public_id": null, "university": "UIT", "cv_public_id": "my_app/docs/0b585ed3-8bf4-42d0-a42d-89494b3b0b54"}, "tools": ["IntelliJ", "Jira", "Docker", "AWS", "GitHub Actions", "Cloudflare Tunnel", "Prometheus", "Grafana", "Dozzle", "Git", "Postman", "Swagger"], "projects": [{"name": "AI Mock Interview Platform", "role": null, "outcome": null, "teamSize": null, "usedTools": ["Spring Boot", "FastAPI", "GenAI", "Redis", "PostgreSQL"], "description": "Orchestrated a microservices architecture leveraging a Redis-backed state machine to drive dynamic, interactive AI mock interviews. Implemented a Meta-driven RAG grading engine combining direct PostgreSQL queries and Gemini/Gemma models for real-time ‘response evaluation. Delivered end-to-end platform features, encompassing AI-driven CV/JD parsing, personalized learning roadmaps, and a scalable mentor booking system with PayOS integration."}, {"name": "Personal Home Lab Server", "role": null, "outcome": null, "teamSize": null, "usedTools": ["Ubuntu", "Docker", "Cloudflare Zero Trust", "CI/CD", "Dozzle", "Beszel"], "description": "Provisioned a bare-metal Ubuntu 24.04 server, securely exposing web and database services via Cloudflare Tunnel (Zero Trust) and Ngrok TCP. Architected a GitOps pull-based CI/CD pipeline using GitHub Actions and Watchtower. Implemented comprehensive observability using Dozzle and Beszel, integrating cross-layer traceId logging."}, {"name": "Online Food Ordering App", "role": null, "outcome": null, "teamSize": null, "usedTools": ["Spring Boot", "Spring Cloud", "Microservices", "RabbitMQ", "JWT"], "description": "Architected a microservices ecosystem (API Gateway, Eureka, Order, Payment), implementing the Saga pattern to orchestrate distributed transactions. Deployed 7+ containerized backend services on Render, securing core APIs with JWT and optimizing inter-service messaging reliability via RabbitMQ event flows."}], "createdAt": [2026, 3, 26, 14, 36, 7, 143440000], "updatedAt": [2026, 4, 17, 15, 42, 30, 433805000], "educations": [{"gpa": "3.0", "major": "Software Engineering", "degree": null, "school": "FPT University", "end_date": "2026", "start_date": "2022"}], "softSkills": [], "targetRole": "Java Software Engineer", "targetLevel": "Junior", "achievements": ["3rd Prize, City-level Informatics Competition (Middle School)"], "introduction": "software Engineering", "certifications": [], "technicalSkills": ["Java", "Spring Boot", "Spring Cloud", "Python", "FastAPI", "GenAI", "Microservices", "Saga Pattern", "Event-Driven Architecture", "RAG", "REST", "SOAP/XML", "PostgreSQL", "MSSQL", "MySQL", "MongoDB", "Redis", "RabbitMQ", "Redshift", "Snowflake", "Docker", "AWS", "GitHub Actions", "Cloudflare Tunnel", "Prometheus", "Grafana", "Dozzle", "Git", "JIRA", "JUnit", "k6", "Selenium", "Postman", "Swagger"], "workExperiences": [{"company": "En Viet Group", "end_date": "Present", "position": "Software Engineer (Java)", "start_date": "Oct. 2025", "description": "Engineered a centralized, Omni-channel OTA Integration Hub consolidating APIs from major airlines and GDS providers. Integrated non-uniform third-party systems by processing REST/JSON, legacy SOAP/XML and encrypted HTTP requests. Architected event-driven communication flows across microservices. Ensured high system reliability by implementing comprehensive error handling and real-time alerting."}, {"company": "FPT Software", "end_date": "Aug. 2025", "position": "Data Quality Assurance Intern", "start_date": "May 2025", "description": "Participated in testing a large-scale cloud-based aviation data pipeline on AWS. Conducted multi-step data validations across DynamoDB, Redshift, and Snowflake. Collaborated with developers in Agile meetings, tracking and reporting bugs via Jira."}]}', '{"basic_info": {"job_title": "Không xác định", "industry_domain": "Không xác định", "seniority_level": "Không xác định"}, "competencies": {"hard_skills": [], "soft_skills": ["pro"], "tools_and_platforms": []}, "responsibilities": []}', null, '{"domain": "IT", "language": "VI", "difficulty": "FRESHER_BASIC", "interview_mode": "STANDARD_MOCK", "duration_minutes": 30}', null),
        (23, null, 5, null, '2026-04-16 04:23:54.938038', '2026-04-16 13:55:28.079679', 'IT', 'CANCELLED', 'STANDARD_MOCK', null, '0220bf01-6b33-4e1b-a01a-8d7a78791107', null, '{"id": 6, "user": {"id": 5, "name": "Trần Bình An", "role": "USER", "cvUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dimvyno0z/image/upload/v1775745501/my_app/docs/5cbc1648-7684-468b-a546-3719047a22bc.pdf", "email": "binhan@gmail.com", "major": "CNTT", "isActive": true, "password": "123", "avatarUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dimvyno0z/image/upload/v1773564900/my_app/images/koljabyfgesxt5ptp8u5.jpg", "public_id": "my_app/images/koljabyfgesxt5ptp8u5", "university": "ĐH Bách Khoa TPHCM", "cv_public_id": "my_app/docs/5cbc1648-7684-468b-a546-3719047a22bc"}, "tools": ["Git/GitHub/GitLab", "Maven", "Jira", "Swagger", "Docker", "Postman", "JUnit", "xUnit", "Cloudinary", "Firebase Cloud Messaging"], "projects": [{"name": "CHILD VACCINE SCHEDULE TRACKING SYSTEM", "role": "Back-end, Leader", "outcome": "Schedule vaccination, payment, evaluation, update post-vaccination reactions. Track vaccination progress & vaccination history. The facility records vaccination results in the child''s records. The system automatically sends reminder and notification emails. Manage vaccines in stock, users, booking schedules, ...", "teamSize": 3, "usedTools": ["Java", "Spring Boot", "Spring Security", "Spring AI", "MSSQL", "Spring Mail"], "description": "A web application that manages children''s vaccination schedules, allowing parents and health centers to schedule, track, and update vaccination records. Supports individual/group scheduling, automatic reminders, secure payments, and AI-powered customer support."}, {"name": "BAMBI KITCHEN", "role": "Back-end, Leader", "outcome": "Authorization & Authentication ( JW, OAuth2 Google ). Manage menus & recipes. Raw material warehouse management (Inventory, Import/Export, Warning). Order (Custom dishes & available dishes) with ingredient reservation system. Multi-channel payment (Cash, Momo, VNPAY). AI intergration ( Gemini AI - Nutrition & Recommend ).", "teamSize": 6, "usedTools": ["Spring Boot", "Spring Security", "Spring AI", "MSSQL", "Cloudinary", "Firebase Cloud Messaging", "Spring Mail"], "description": "Bambi kitchen is a food chain that specializes in providing healthy dishes and customers can customize and choose personalized dish ingredients step by step, with integrated AI to evaluate orders."}], "createdAt": [2026, 4, 9, 14, 38, 18, 734762000], "updatedAt": [2026, 4, 9, 14, 38, 22, 582891000], "educations": [{"gpa": "3.2", "major": "Software Engineering", "degree": null, "school": "FPT University", "end_date": "2026", "start_date": "2022"}], "softSkills": ["Teamwork", "English", "Fast learner", "Adaptability", "Problem-solving", "Technical Reading"], "targetRole": "Java Developer", "targetLevel": "Junior", "achievements": ["HONORABLE STUDENT OF TRIMESTER Semester 1, 3, 4, 5", "Admissions Collaborator -FPT University"], "introduction": "As a Java Developer, I am eager to work in a challenging environment to develop my skills and gain practical experience. I leverage my logical thinking and passion for programming to quickly transform knowledge into practical solutions, aiming to become an effective and well-grounded software development specialist.", "certifications": ["Web Design for Everybody: Basics of Web Development & Coding", "Software Development Lifecycle", "Java FullStack Developer"], "technicalSkills": ["Java", "C#", "HTML/CSS", "Spring Security", "Spring Data JPA", "Spring MVC", "MSSQL", "PostgreSQL", "JPA/Hibernate", "MongoDB", "ASP .NET", "SignalR", "Spring Boot", "Spring AI"], "workExperiences": [{"company": "FPT Software Academy", "end_date": "08/2025", "position": ".NET Developer Intern", "start_date": "05/2025", "description": "Final Training Project: Movie Theater. Role: Back-end, Leader. Developed an online movie ticketing system featuring real-time seat map visualization. Developed modules: movie management, showtimes, theaters, promotions, user accounts, and points accumulation. Authorization & Authentication (Cookie Authentication). Designed the entire database and processing flow architecture for the modules. Actively learned and mastered all modules, acted as a connection point between sections, divided tasks and guided the team to implement code according to the design. Performed work under the supervision of the mentor, ensuring project progress and quality."}]}', '{"basic_info": {"job_title": "Java Backend Developer", "industry_domain": "Công nghệ thông tin", "seniority_level": "Junior"}, "competencies": {"hard_skills": ["Java", "Spring Boot", "REST API", "SQL"], "soft_skills": ["Giao tiếp", "Giải quyết vấn đề"], "tools_and_platforms": ["Docker", "Git"]}, "responsibilities": []}', null, '{"domain": "IT", "language": "VI", "difficulty": "FRESHER_BASIC", "interview_mode": "STANDARD_MOCK", "duration_minutes": 30}', null),
