, Momo, VNPAY). AI intergration ( Gemini AI - Nutrition & Recommend ).", "teamSize": 6, "usedTools": ["Spring Boot", "Spring Security", "Spring AI", "MSSQL", "Cloudinary", "Firebase Cloud Messaging", "Spring Mail"], "description": "Bambi kitchen is a food chain that specializes in providing healthy dishes and customers can customize and choose personalized dish ingredients step by step, with integrated AI to evaluate orders."}], "createdAt": [2026, 4, 9, 14, 38, 18, 734762000], "updatedAt": [2026, 4, 9, 14, 38, 22, 582891000], "educations": [{"gpa": "3.2", "major": "Software Engineering", "degree": null, "school": "FPT University", "end_date": "2026", "start_date": "2022"}], "softSkills": ["Teamwork", "English", "Fast learner", "Adaptability", "Problem-solving", "Technical Reading"], "targetRole": "Java Developer", "targetLevel": "Junior", "achievements": ["HONORABLE STUDENT OF TRIMESTER Semester 1, 3, 4, 5", "Admissions Collaborator -FPT University"], "introduction": "As a Java Developer, I am eager to work in a challenging environment to develop my skills and gain practical experience. I leverage my logical thinking and passion for programming to quickly transform knowledge into practical solutions, aiming to become an effective and well-grounded software development specialist.", "certifications": ["Web Design for Everybody: Basics of Web Development & Coding", "Software Development Lifecycle", "Java FullStack Developer"], "technicalSkills": ["Java", "C#", "HTML/CSS", "Spring Security", "Spring Data JPA", "Spring MVC", "MSSQL", "PostgreSQL", "JPA/Hibernate", "MongoDB", "ASP .NET", "SignalR", "Spring Boot", "Spring AI"], "workExperiences": [{"company": "FPT Software Academy", "end_date": "08/2025", "position": ".NET Developer Intern", "start_date": "05/2025", "description": "Final Training Project: Movie Theater. Role: Back-end, Leader. Developed an online movie ticketing system featuring real-time seat map visualization. Developed modules: movie management, showt