        (67, '{"strengths": ["Exceptional clarity and relevance of content, including specific skills and experience.", "Highly professional and appropriate tone.", "Well-structured with good use of bullet points for readability.", "Comprehensive and professionally formatted signature with all relevant links."], "weaknesses": ["Critically uninformative subject line, which could lead to the email being overlooked or misfiled."], "extraMetrics": {"Content And Clarity": {"score": 25, "comment": "The content is exceptionally clear, concise, and highly relevant. It effectively highlights key skills, years of experience, and alignment with the company''s products. The inclusion of attachments and portfolio context is excellent.", "maxScore": 25}, "Subject Line Quality": {"score": 1, "comment": "The subject line ''[INBLUE-APP-55]'' is an internal reference code and lacks crucial information such as the position applied for and the candidate''s name, making it uninformative and easily overlooked.", "maxScore": 10}, "Closing And Signature": {"score": 10, "comment": "The closing is polite and professional, expressing anticipation for next steps. The signature is comprehensive, including all necessary contact information and relevant links, making it easy for the recruiter to follow up.", "maxScore": 10}, "Grammar And Vocabulary": {"score": 20, "comment": "Assuming the Vietnamese is correct, the email is grammatically flawless and uses appropriate, professional vocabulary throughout. There are no spelling errors or awkward phrasing.", "maxScore": 20}, "Salutation And Opening": {"score": 8, "comment": "The salutation ''Kính gửi Ban Tuyển dụng / Anh/Chị [Tên Nhà Tuyển Dụng]'' is a good attempt at personalization but remains generic as the specific name is missing. The opening clearly states the purpose and position.", "maxScore": 10}, "Formatting And Structure": {"score": 5, "comment": "The email is very well-structured, utilizing bullet points effectively for skills, which sign