        (419, '{"strengths": ["Clear and concise communication of immediate and long-term solutions.", "Proactive in offering further direct support.", "Polite, apologetic, and solution-oriented tone.", "Excellent grammar, vocabulary, and clear structure."], "weaknesses": ["Uninformative subject line.", "Significant role mismatch in the signature (Junior candidate signing as Head of Customer Service).", "Implies an access link was sent externally, but no direct link or reference is provided within this email.", "The professional title used in the signature is inconsistent with the candidate''s ''JUNIOR'' level."], "extraMetrics": {"Content And Clarity": {"score": 15, "comment": "The email clearly outlines both immediate and long-term solutions without being overly technical. It also offers further support. However, the signature indicates ''Head of Customer Service'' while the candidate is ''JUNIOR'', which is a significant role mismatch. Additionally, it implies an access link was sent ''qua email quản trị'' but no such link is provided in this email, which is a detail oversight.", "maxScore": 25}, "Subject Line Quality": {"score": 1, "comment": "The subject line ''[INBLUE-APP-173]'' is an internal reference code and fails to provide context about the email''s purpose, making it uninformative for the recipient.", "maxScore": 10}, "Closing And Signature": {"score": 8, "comment": "The closing ''Trân trọng,'' is polite. The signature includes the candidate''s name and a functional title, but the title ''Trưởng bộ phận Chăm sóc Khách hàng'' (Head of Customer Service) contradicts the ''JUNIOR'' level of the candidate.", "maxScore": 10}, "Grammar And Vocabulary": {"score": 20, "comment": "The Vietnamese used is grammatically correct and employs appropriate, professional vocabulary throughout the email.", "maxScore": 20}, "Salutation And Opening": {"score": 9, "comment": "The salutation ''Kính gửi chị Sarah,'' is appropriate. The opening effectively acknowledges the issue and its impact, setting a positive and receptive tone.", "maxScore": 10}, "Formatting And Structure": {"score": 5, "comment": "The email is well-structured with clear paragraphs and bullet points, enhancing readability.", "maxScore": 5}, "Tone And Professionalism": {"score": 12, "comment": "The tone is professional, apologetic, and solution-oriented. However, the discrepancy between the candidate''s ''JUNIOR'' level and the ''Head of Customer Service'' title in the signature is a critical professional inconsistency.", "maxScore": 20}}, "generalComment": "This email effectively communicates solutions for a service interruption with clarity and a professional tone. However, the uninformative subject line, the implied missing access details, and the critical mismatch between the candidate''s ''JUNIOR'' level and the ''Head of Customer Service'' signature are significant professional oversights."}', 70, 173, '2026-08-15 14:32:38.019160', '2026-08-15 14:24:00.182787', 'PASSED', 70, 'Khá là chuyên nghiệp có đầy đủ rõ ràng mửo bài kết bài', 70, 679, '2026-08-15 14:24:00.182810', 'COMPLETED', '{"fileUrl": null, "quizAnswers": null, "textContent": null, "codeSubmissions": null, "emailSubmissionId": 1342, "codeReviewSubmissions": null}', '2026-08-15 14:32:38.028751', null, null, null, null, null, null),
        (115, '{"strengths": ["Nền tảng học vấn tốt về Kỹ thuật Phần mềm tại FPT University với GPA khá cao, cho thấy khả năng tiếp thu kiến thức tốt.", "Có kiến thức vững chắc về các công nghệ Back-end Java như Spring Boot, Spring Cloud, Microservices và các cơ sở dữ liệu như PostgreSQL, MongoDB, cùng với các công cụ phát triển như Git, Docker, Jira và JUnit.", "Thể hiện sự quan tâm và khả năng áp dụng các công cụ AI (GenAI SDK, RAG, Gemini/Gemma) và kiến thức về DevOps (Docker, AWS, CI/CD)."], "weaknesses": ["Thiếu kinh nghiệm làm việc thực tế, đã hoàn thành và có thể kiểm chứng, do tất cả các mục kinh nghiệm/dự án đều có ngày bắt đầu trong tương lai.", "Chưa đáp ứng yêu cầu tối thiểu về số năm kinh nghiệm internship (1 năm) cho vị trí Fresher.", "Kinh nghiệm với một số Messaging Queues và kiến thức về các thực hành tối ưu hiệu năng/mở rộng còn hạn chế hoặc chưa được thể hiện rõ ràng trong CV."], "extraMetrics": {"Keyword Density": {"AI": 2, "AWS": 2, "Git": 1, "APIs": 0, "JIRA": 1, "Java": 5, "MQTT": 0, "REST": 1, "JUnit": 1, "Kafka": 0, "Scrum": 0, "Docker": 2, "MongoDB": 1, "caching": 0, "ActiveMQ": 0, "RabbitMQ": 1, "PostgreSQL": 2, "Spring Boot": 3, "Microservices": 3, "load balancer": 0, "web applications": 0}, "Overall CV Match": 10, "Skills Match Score": 60, "Potential Red Flags": ["Tất cả kinh nghiệm làm việc (internship) và các dự án lớn đều được ghi với ngày tháng trong tương lai (2025), điều này gây nghi ngờ về tính xác thực của kinh nghiệm thực tế đã hoàn thành và cho thấy ứng viên hiện tại chưa có kinh nghiệm làm việc chính thức.", "Hoàn toàn không đáp ứng yêu cầu \"At least 1 year of internship experience in Java Engineering\" vì các kinh nghiệm và dự án đều chưa diễn ra.", "Ứng viên đang là sinh viên, chưa tốt nghiệp đại học (dự kiến 2026), có thể chưa đáp ứng đầy đủ yêu cầu về bằng cấp và kinh nghiệm cho vị trí Fresher theo định nghĩa thông thường của JD.", "Thiếu kinh nghiệm cụ thể với các hệ thống Messaging Queues (Kafka, MQTT, ActiveMQ) và kiến thức về các thực hành tối ưu hiệu năng/mở rộng (load balancer, caching) được đề cập là điểm cộng/yêu cầu."], "CV Readability Score": 90, "Education Match Score": 60, "Experience Match Score": 0}, "generalComment": "Ứng viên là một sinh viên có tiềm năng với nền tảng học vấn tốt và kiến thức lý thuyết vững chắc về Java Backend cùng các công nghệ hiện đại. Tuy nhiên, hồ sơ này không phù hợp với vị trí Fresher Java Engineer do thiếu hụt nghiêm trọng kinh nghiệm làm việc thực tế, đã hoàn thành và có thể kiểm chứng, đặc biệt là yêu cầu \"At least 1 year of internship experience\". Ứng viên có thể là một ứng cử viên phù hợp cho các vị trí thực tập sinh (internship) bắt đầu từ năm 2025 hoặc các vị trí Fresher trong tương lai sau khi hoàn thành các kinh nghiệm đã liệt kê."}', 17.5, 78, '2026-07-18 05:58:02.317373', '2026-07-18 05:47:52.349014', 'PASSED', 90, 'ok', 90, 113, '2026-07-18 05:47:52.349055', 'COMPLETED', '{"fileUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/dimvyno0z/image/upload/v1784353671/my_app/docs/3b4af9fd-29b7-457b-a260-ef372c7ae319.pdf", "quizAnswers": null, "textContent": null, "codeSubmissions": null, "emailSubmissionId": null, "codeReviewSubmissions": null}', '2026-07-18 05:58:02.318181', null, null, null, null, null, null),
        (253, '{"strengths": ["Clear and concise communication of a critical technical issue in non-technical terms.", "Provides a clear solution, next steps, and an estimated timeline.", "Excellent grammar, vocabulary, and overall structure.", "Appropriately addresses both Project Manager and Customer."], "weaknesses": ["Critical mismatch between the sender''s name in the email address (''Thu Hà Nguyễn Phạm'') and the name in the signature (''Huu Khang''). This is a significant professional inconsistency.", "The subject line is uninformative, which is a critical oversight for an urgent communication to external stakeholders.", "Could have explicitly acknowledged the impact of the delay on the customer''s business or project timeline to further manage expectations."], "extraMetrics": {"Content And Clarity": {"score": 20, "comment": "The email clearly informs about the critical bug (double billing), provides a concise, non-technical explanation, proposes a clear solution (postponing handover for fix and retest), and gives a precise ETA (2 working days). It also commits to regular updates. It effectively covers all required points.", "maxScore": 25}, "Subject Line Quality": {"score": 1, "comment": "The subject line ''[INBLUE-APP-115]'' is an internal reference code and fails to convey the urgency or purpose of the email, especially for the customer.", "maxScore": 10}, "Closing And Signature": {"score": 10, "comment": "The closing ''Trân trọng,'' is polite and professional. The signature ''Huu Khang, Software Engineer'' is clear and complete, but critically contradicts the sender''s email name, reducing the overall professionalism.", "maxScore": 10}, "Grammar And Vocabulary": {"score": 20, "comment": "The Vietnamese used is grammatically correct and employs appropriate, professional vocabulary throughout the email.", "maxScore": 20}, "Salutation And Opening": {"score": 9, "comment": "The salutation ''Kính gửi Anh/Chị Project Manager và Quý Khách hàng,'' is appropriate and professional, addressing both key audiences. The opening clearly states the critical issue.", "maxScore": 10}, "Formatting And Structure": {"score": 5, "comment": "The email is well-structured with clear paragraphs, making it easy to read and understand the flow of information.", "maxScore": 5}, "Tone And Professionalism": {"score": 10, "comment": "The tone is professional and takes collective responsibility. However, there is a critical mismatch between the sender''s name in the email address (''Thu Hà Nguyễn Phạm'') and the name in the signature (''Huu Khang''), which is a significant professional oversight.", "maxScore": 20}}, "generalComment": "This email effectively communicates a critical project issue with clarity and professionalism in its content. However, the significant inconsistency between the sender''s email name and the signature, along with an uninformative subject line, are critical professional oversights that undermine trust and clarity."}', 75, 115, '2026-08-02 16:30:24.116830', '2026-08-02 15:57:10.488157', 'PASSED', 15, 'CẦN BÙ BÙ SIÊNG NĂNG CÓ LÀM THÌ MỚI CÓ ĂN', 15, 644, '2026-08-02 15:57:10.488186', 'COMPLETED', '{"fileUrl": null, "quizAnswers": null, "textContent": null, "codeSubmissions": null, "emailSubmissionId": 1288, "codeReviewSubmissions": null}', '2026-08-02 16:30:24.131298', null, null, null, null, null, null),
        (319, '{"strengths": ["Excellent grammar and professional vocabulary within the written text.", "Well-structured body and clear formatting."], "weaknesses": ["Critically uninformative subject line.", "Unedited placeholder in the salutation.", "Explicitly states attachments (CV and Portfolio) are included, but none are present.", "Fundamental mismatch between the email''s content (Senior role, 4 years experience) and the provided application level (JUNIOR).", "Incomplete signature block, missing vital contact information.", "Demonstrates a severe lack of attention to detail and understanding of the application process."], "extraMetrics": {"Content And Clarity": {"score": 0, "comment": "The content describes a candidate with ''4 years of experience'' applying for a ''Senior UI/UX Designer'' position, which is a critical mismatch with the ''JUNIOR'' level provided in the scenario. Additionally, the email explicitly states ''Tôi đính kèm theo email này CV và Portfolio'' (I have attached my CV and Portfolio), but no attachments were actually included, which is a severe professional error and makes the content misleading.", "maxScore": 25}, "Subject Line Quality": {"score": 1, "comment": "The subject line ''[INBLUE-APP-135]'' is an internal reference code and critically lacks essential information such as the position applied for and the candidate''s name, making it uninformative and easily overlooked.", "maxScore": 10}, "Closing And Signature": {"score": 3, "comment": "The closing phrase is polite and professional. However, the signature block is incomplete, only listing the name and missing critical contact information like phone, email, and LinkedIn, which were present in similar examples.", "maxScore": 10}, "Grammar And Vocabulary": {"score": 20, "comment": "Assuming the Vietnamese is correct, the email is grammatically flawless and uses appropriate, professional vocabulary throughout. There are no spelling errors or awkward phrasing.", "maxScore": 20}, "Salutation And Opening": {"score": 3, "comment": "The salutation ''Kính gửi Ban Tuyển dụng / Anh/Chị [Tên Nhà Tuyển Dụng],'' includes an unedited placeholder, indicating a lack of attention to detail. Furthermore, the opening states an application for a ''Senior'' role with ''4 years experience'', which critically mismatches the ''JUNIOR'' level context provided.", "maxScore": 10}, "Formatting And Structure": {"score": 5, "comment": "The email is very well-structured, utilizing bullet points effectively for skills, which significantly enhances readability and highlights key information. Paragraphs are logical and flow well.", "maxScore": 5}, "Tone And Professionalism": {"score": 5, "comment": "While the language itself is formal, the fundamental errors of applying for the wrong level, failing to edit the placeholder, and most critically, stating that attachments are included when they are not, demonstrate a severe lack of attention to detail and professionalism regarding the specific application process.", "maxScore": 20}}, "generalComment": "This email is critically flawed due to a fundamental mismatch between the candidate''s stated experience/target role and the ''JUNIOR'' level specified in the application context. Combined with missing attachments, an unedited placeholder, and an incomplete signature, this reflects a significant lack of attention to detail and professionalism in the application process."}', 37, 135, null, '2026-08-07 00:39:18.868446', null, null, null, null, 361, '2026-08-07 00:39:18.868446', 'AI_EVALUATED', '{"fileUrl": null, "quizAnswers": null, "textContent": null, "codeSubmissions": null, "emailSubmissionId": 1311, "codeReviewSubmissions": null}', '2026-08-07 00:39:18.868446', null, null, null, null, null, null),
