        (116, '{"strengths": ["Comprehensive and well-formatted professional signature block."], "weaknesses": ["Critical lack of meaningful content in the email body.", "Absence of any proper salutation or opening.", "Uninformative subject line for a job application/submission.", "Fails to convey any purpose or problem-solving intent.", "Highly unprofessional and demonstrates a severe lack of attention to detail."], "extraMetrics": {"Content And Clarity": {"score": 0, "comment": "The body content ''1234'' is entirely unclear and unprofessional. It conveys no information, context, or purpose, failing to address any problem or provide relevant details.", "maxScore": 25}, "Subject Line Quality": {"score": 1, "comment": "The subject line is an internal reference code, lacking essential information like the purpose of the email or the position, making it uninformative for the recipient.", "maxScore": 10}, "Closing And Signature": {"score": 9, "comment": "The closing phrase ''Thank you and Warmest Regards'' is acceptable. The signature block is comprehensive and professionally formatted, providing all necessary contact information.", "maxScore": 10}, "Grammar And Vocabulary": {"score": 5, "comment": "Minimal content makes assessment difficult. The professional language in the closing and signature is good, but the critical body content is absent and inappropriate.", "maxScore": 20}, "Salutation And Opening": {"score": 0, "comment": "Completely missing a formal salutation. The email starts abruptly with ''1234'', which is highly inappropriate for professional communication.", "maxScore": 10}, "Formatting And Structure": {"score": 1, "comment": "The main body lacks any proper structure or content. While the signature is well-formatted, the overall email structure is severely deficient due to the empty and meaningless body.", "maxScore": 5}, "Tone And Professionalism": {"score": 2, "comment": "The informal and meaningless body content, coupled with the lack of salutation, is highly unprofessional. While the signature block attempts professionalism, the email''s core message severely undermines it.", "maxScore": 20}}, "generalComment": "This email is critically deficient as a professional communication. The candidate''s lack of substantive content and informal opening demonstrate a severe oversight in professional email etiquette, making it impossible to evaluate their actual application or submission."}', 18, 78, '2026-07-18 06:02:57.797407', '2026-07-18 06:02:33.729781', 'PASSED', 90, 'ok', 90, 114, '2026-07-18 06:02:33.729793', 'COMPLETED', '{"fileUrl": null, "quizAnswers": null, "textContent": null, "codeSubmissions": null, "emailSubmissionId": 1205, "codeReviewSubmissions": null}', '2026-07-18 06:02:57.798950', null, null, null, null, null, null),
