        (152, '{"strengths": ["Exceptional clarity and relevance of content, including specific skills and experience.", "Highly professional and appropriate tone.", "Well-structured with good use of bullet points for readability.", "Comprehensive and professionally formatted signature with all relevant links."], "weaknesses": ["Critically uninformative subject line, which could lead to the email being overlooked or misfiled.", "Unedited placeholder in the salutation ''Anh/Chị [Tên Nhà Tuyển Dụng]''."], "extraMetrics": {"Content And Clarity": {"score": 25, "comment": "The content is exceptionally clear, concise, and highly relevant. It effectively highlights key skills, years of experience, and alignment with the company''s products. The inclusion of attachments and portfolio context is excellent.", "maxScore": 25}, "Subject Line Quality": {"score": 1, "comment": "The subject line ''[INBLUE-APP-91]'' is an internal reference code and lacks crucial information such as the position applied for and the candidate''s name, making it uninformative and easily overlooked.", "maxScore": 10}, "Closing And Signature": {"score": 10, "comment": "The closing is polite and professional, expressing anticipation for next steps. The signature is comprehensive, including all necessary contact information and relevant links, making it easy for the recruiter to follow up.", "maxScore": 10}, "Grammar And Vocabulary": {"score": 20, "comment": "Assuming the Vietnamese is correct, the email is grammatically flawless and uses appropriate, professional vocabulary throughout. There are no spelling errors or awkward phrasing.", "maxScore": 20}, "Salutation And Opening": {"score": 8, "comment": "The salutation ''Kính gửi Ban Tuyển dụng / Anh/Chị [Tên Nhà Tuyển Dụng]'' is a good attempt at personalization but remains generic as the specific name placeholder was not edited. The opening clearly states the purpose and position.", "maxScore": 10}, "Formatting And Structure": {"score": 5, "comment": "The email is very well-structured, utilizing bullet points effectively for skills, which significantly enhances readability and highlights key information. Paragraphs are logical and flow well.", "maxScore": 5}, "Tone And Professionalism": {"score": 20, "comment": "The tone is consistently professional, confident, and enthusiastic, which is highly appropriate for a job application. It conveys genuine interest and competence.", "maxScore": 20}}, "generalComment": "This is a very strong application email demonstrating excellent communication skills, relevant experience, and a professional demeanor. The only significant areas for improvement are the subject line, which needs to be more descriptive, and refining the salutation to remove the placeholder."}', 89, 91, '2026-07-21 09:16:02.492402', '2026-07-21 09:14:18.960473', 'PASSED', 100, 'good', 100, 361, '2026-07-21 09:14:18.960502', 'COMPLETED', '{"fileUrl": null, "quizAnswers": null, "textContent": null, "codeSubmissions": null, "emailSubmissionId": 1214, "codeReviewSubmissions": null}', '2026-07-21 09:16:02.493636', null, null, null, null, null, null),
        (153, null, null, 91, null, '2026-07-21 09:16:22.064900', 'FAILED', 0, null, null, 362, '2026-07-21 09:16:22.064968', 'COMPLETED', '{"fileUrl": null, "quizAnswers": [{"isCorrect": false, "questionText": "In JavaScript, what is the result of the expression console.log(typeof NaN)?", "selectedAnswer": "A"}, {"isCorrect": false, "questionText": "What is the correct result of the following code snippet:\n```javascript\nconst a = [1, 2, 3];\nconst b = a;\nb.push(4);\nconsole.log(a.length);\n```", "selectedAnswer": "A"}, {"isCorrect": false, "questionText": "In CSS, which property is used to center an absolutely positioned child element both vertically and horizontally?", "selectedAnswer": "A"}, {"isCorrect": false, "questionText": "In React, when does the `useEffect` Hook with an empty dependency array `[]` execute?", "selectedAnswer": "A"}], "textContent": null, "codeSubmissions": null, "emailSubmissionId": null, "codeReviewSubmissions": null}', '2026-07-21 09:16:22.064987', null, null, null, null, null, null),
        (155, null, null, 91, null, '2026-07-21 09:18:26.396998', 'PASSED', 100, null, null, 363, '2026-07-21 09:18:26.397037', 'COMPLETED', '{"fileUrl": null, "quizAnswers": null, "textContent": "// --- Problem 4 ---\nclass Solution {\n    public int[] solution(int[] nums,int target) {\n                java.util.HashMap<Integer,Integer> map = new java.util.HashMap<>();\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < nums.length; i++) {\n            int complement = target - nums[i];\n\n            if (map.containsKey(complement)) {\n                return new int[]{map.get(complement),i};\n            }\n\n            map.put(nums[i],i);\n        }\n\n        return new int[]{};\n    }\n}", "codeSubmissions": [{"testCases": {"status": "ERROR", "testCases": [{"index": 0, "input": ", ", "status": "ERROR", "actualOutput": null, "errorMessage": "RUNTIME_ERROR: Exception in thread \"main\" java.lang.StringIndexOutOfBoundsException: begin 1, end -1, length 0\n\tat java.base/java.lang.String.checkBoundsBeginEnd(String.java:4606)\n\tat java.base/java.lang.String.substring(String.java:2709)\n\tat TypeParser.parseIntArray(Solution.java:54)\n\tat Solution.main(Solution.java:24)", "expectedOutput": "", "executionTimeMs": 132}, {"index": 1, "input": "[3,2,4], 6", "status": "PASSED", "actualOutput": "[1,2]", "errorMessage": null, "expectedOutput": "[1,2]", "executionTimeMs": 164}, {"index": 2, "input": "[3,3], 6", "status": "PASSED", "actualOutput": "[0,1]", "errorMessage": null, "expectedOutput": "[0,1]", "executionTimeMs": 139}, {"index": 3, "input": "[-1,-2,-3,-4,-5], -8", "status": "PASSED", "actualOutput": "[2,4]", "errorMessage": null, "expectedOutput": "[2,4]", "executionTimeMs": 170}, {"index": 4, "input": "[1000000000,1,1000000000,2], 3", "status": "PASSED", "actualOutput": "[1,3]", "errorMessage": null, "expectedOutput": "[1,3]", "executionTimeMs": 176}, {"index": 5, "input": "[-1,0,1,2,-2], 0", "status": "PASSED", "actualOutput": "[0,2]", "errorMessage": null, "expectedOutput": "[0,2]