ation And Opening": {"score": 3, "comment": "The salutation ''Kính gửi Ban Tuyển dụng / Anh/Chị [Tên Nhà Tuyển Dụng],'' includes an unedited placeholder, indicating a lack of attention to detail. Furthermore, the opening states an application for a ''Senior'' role with ''4 years experience'', which critically mismatches the ''JUNIOR'' level context provided.", "maxScore": 10}, "Formatting And Structure": {"score": 5, "comment": "The email is very well-structured, utilizing bullet points effectively for skills, which significantly enhances readability and highlights key information. Paragraphs are logical and flow well.", "maxScore": 5}, "Tone And Professionalism": {"score": 5, "comment": "While the language itself is formal, the fundamental errors of applying for the wrong level, failing to edit the placeholder, and most critically, stating that attachments are included when they are not, demonstrate a severe lack of attention to detail and professionalism regarding the specific application process.", "maxScore": 20}}, "generalComment": "This email is critically flawed due to a fundamental mismatch between the candidate''s stated experience/target role and the ''JUNIOR'' level specified in the application context. Combined with missing attachments, an unedited placeholder, and an incomplete signature, this reflects a significant lack of attention to detail and professionalism in the application process."}', 37, 101, '2026-07-25 07:32:57.805382', '2026-07-25 07:31:51.548555', 'PASSED', 40, 'good', 40, 361, '2026-07-25 07:31:51.548577', 'COMPLETED', '{"fileUrl": null, "quizAnswers": null, "textContent": null, "codeSubmissions": null, "emailSubmissionId": 1243, "codeReviewSubmissions": null}', '2026-07-25 07:32:57.806517', null, null, null, null, null, null),
