        (300, '{"strengths": ["Excellent grammar and professional vocabulary within the written text.", "Well-structured body with clear formatting and use of bullet points.", "Comprehensive and professional signature (despite implying missing attachments)."], "weaknesses": ["Critically uninformative subject line.", "Unedited placeholder in the salutation.", "Explicitly states attachments (CV and Portfolio) are included, but none are present.", "Fundamental mismatch between the email''s content (Senior role, 4 years experience) and the provided application level (JUNIOR).", "Demonstrates a severe lack of attention to detail and understanding of the application process."], "extraMetrics": {"Content And Clarity": {"score": 0, "comment": "The content describes a candidate with ''4 years of experience'' applying for a ''Senior UI/UX Designer'' position, which is a critical mismatch with the ''JUNIOR'' level provided in the scenario. Additionally, the email explicitly states ''Tôi đính kèm theo email này CV và Portfolio'' (I have attached my CV and Portfolio), but no attachments were actually included, which is a severe professional error and makes the content misleading.", "maxScore": 25}, "Subject Line Quality": {"score": 1, "comment": "The subject line ''[INBLUE-APP-132]'' is an internal reference code and critically lacks essential information such as the position applied for and the candidate''s name, making it uninformative and easily overlooked.", "maxScore": 10}, "Closing And Signature": {"score": 8, "comment": "The closing is polite and professional. The signature is comprehensive, including all necessary contact information and relevant links, but it implies attachments that are missing.", "maxScore": 10}, "Grammar And Vocabulary": {"score": 20, "comment": "Assuming the Vietnamese is correct, the email is grammatically flawless and uses appropriate, professional vocabulary throughout. There are no spelling errors or awkward phrasing.", "maxScore": 20}, "Salutation And Opening": {"score": 3, "comment": "The salutation ''Kính gửi Ban Tuyển dụng / Anh/Chị [Tên Nhà Tuyển Dụng],'' includes an unedited placeholder, indicating a lack of attention to detail. Furthermore, the opening states an application for a ''Senior'' role with ''4 years experience'', which critically mismatches the ''JUNIOR'' level context provided.", "maxScore": 10}, "Formatting And Structure": {"score": 5, "comment": "The email is very well-structured, utilizing bullet points effectively for skills, which significantly enhances readability and highlights key information. Paragraphs are logical and flow well.", "maxScore": 5}, "Tone And Professionalism": {"score": 5, "comment": "While the language itself is formal, the fundamental errors of applying for the wrong level, failing to edit the placeholder, and most critically, stating that attachments are included when they are not, demonstrate a severe lack of attention to detail and professionalism regarding the specific application process.", "maxScore": 20}}, "generalComment": "This email is critically flawed due to a fundamental mismatch between the candidate''s stated experience/target role and the ''JUNIOR'' level specified in the application context. Combined with missing attachments and an unedited placeholder, this reflects a significant lack of attention to detail and professionalism in the application process."}', 42, 132, '2026-08-06 06:47:20.687279', '2026-08-05 20:41:27.936070', 'PASSED', 50, 'gg', 50, 361, '2026-08-05 20:41:27.936086', 'COMPLETED', '{"fileUrl": null, "quizAnswers": null, "textContent": null, "codeSubmissions": null, "emailSubmissionId": 1304, "codeReviewSubmissions": null}', '2026-08-06 06:47:20.704207', null, null, null, null, null, null),
