        (326, '{"strengths": ["The salutation is polite."], "weaknesses": ["Critically incomplete content, with a placeholder indicating a lack of effort.", "Uninformative subject line.", "Mismatch between sender''s email name and signature name.", "Overall unprofessionalism and lack of attention to detail.", "Fails to convey any meaningful information."], "extraMetrics": {"Content And Clarity": {"score": 0, "comment": "The content is critically incomplete, consisting of only a placeholder phrase ''về vấn đề đang xảy ra...''. It fails to provide any actual information or address any specific issue, rendering it entirely uninformative and unprofessional.", "maxScore": 25}, "Subject Line Quality": {"score": 1, "comment": "The subject line ''[INBLUE-APP-112]'' is an internal reference code and provides no context about the email''s purpose, making it uninformative and easily overlooked.", "maxScore": 10}, "Closing And Signature": {"score": 3, "comment": "The closing ''Trân trọng,'' is appropriate. However, the signature ''Trần Bình An'' contradicts the sender''s name in the email address (''Tran Nhat Tan''), which is a significant professional inconsistency.", "maxScore": 10}, "Grammar And Vocabulary": {"score": 2, "comment": "While the few words present are grammatically correct, the email is functionally incomplete due to the placeholder, making it a grammatical failure in context.", "maxScore": 20}, "Salutation And Opening": {"score": 4, "comment": "The salutation ''Kính gửi Anh/Chị,'' is appropriate. However, the opening ''Em xin phép phản hồi email của Anh/Chị về vấn đề đang xảy ra...'' is generic and incomplete, indicating a lack of effort.", "maxScore": 10}, "Formatting And Structure": {"score": 0, "comment": "The email has a basic structure but is critically lacking in content, making its formatting irrelevant due to the emptiness of the message.", "maxScore": 5}, "Tone And Professionalism": {"score": 0, "comment": "The tone is unprofessional due to the incomplete and generic nature of the email. It suggests a severe lack of attention to detail and effort from the sender.", "maxScore": 20}}, "generalComment": "This email is critically unprofessional and incomplete. It appears to be an unedited draft or a placeholder, demonstrating a severe lack of attention to detail and effort, which is unacceptable for any professional communication, especially from an intern."}', 10, 112, '2026-08-07 10:49:53.304146', '2026-08-07 10:40:40.285209', 'PASSED', 70, '100', 70, 724, '2026-08-07 10:40:40.285288', 'COMPLETED', '{"fileUrl": null, "quizAnswers": null, "textContent": null, "codeSubmissions": null, "emailSubmissionId": 1316, "codeReviewSubmissions": null}', '2026-08-07 10:49:53.309463', null, null, null, null, null, null),
