        (96, null, '[]', 'Pearson Maintenance

25th & 26th November, 2nd December
Downtime: 6.00am - 2.00pm UTC


 
 Hello,


Pearson have scheduled a significant engineering enhancement to our backend entitlement service which is designed to improve future performance and stability.

There are a number of stages to this upgrade and the team have planned to complete all elements in separate change windows, listed as follows:

	- Saturday 25th November 6am-2pm UTC
	- Sunday 26th November 6am-2pm UTC
	- Saturday 2nd December 6am-2pm UTC 
In order to reduce any inconvenience the engineering team will look at how to consolidate the upgrade into one process and window, however until further notice the above outage windows will be required. During these windows, multiple Pearson systems, including Pearson English Portal, MyEnglishLab, Pearson English Connect and Reader+, will be unavailable.



Kind regards,


Change Management Support

