.', '2026-06-25 17:27:05.923559', 'Missing or invalid application ID in subject', '2024-02-08 18:10:12.000000', 'Cisco Networking Academy <netacademail@external.cisco.com>', 'IGNORED', 'Important! Action required before January 1, 2024'),
        (107, null, '[]', 'Dear Students,




A previous email was sent with an incorrect date. Please note the corrected date of February 22, 2024. We apologize for any confusion. 




Cisco Networking Academy is launching a new web experience in July 2024. We need your help to get ready. Take these 2 steps now:




Step 1 – Review email address before February 22, 2024


	- Check that your NetAcad.com and SkillsForAll.com email addresses are the same.
	- If they do not match, change your NetAcad.com email address to match your SkillForAll.com email address before February 22, 2024. That’s it!



Step 2 – Change Password between February 24 – July 19, 2024


	- After February 23, 2024, most users will be prompted to change their password when they login to either NetAcad.com or SkillsForAll.com. Your updated password will become your login credential for both sites. We want you to know that the prompt to change your password is a legitimate request. Read Details <http://nsmail.netacad.com/MDU5LVZGWi04MzQAAAGRKl27qYpngWI8OVJ3zNOkk53k7a3QikPdwgfIfagRfD-NFHwtU_8HY66QyGTGjgE4sAN2XBQ=>.

