        (109, null, '[]', 'Dear Nguyễn Phạm Thu, 




Apologies for the earlier confusion. The correct date for the Women Rock IT event is February 29, 2024. Join us for this empowering experience. Details below.




Thank you for your understanding and continued support.
Backstage with the Cisco Dream Team!
Join us for an electrifying episode of Women Rock-IT event on February 29 as we take you on a backstage journey like no other. This is your golden ticket to discover the groundbreaking work behind the scenes of the world''s largest sporting event, the Women''s World Cup Soccer tournament, held in the stunning locales of Australia.
Meet your Speakers and Host
Noor ZafarCyber Security Analyst​
Catherine AshtonCase Project Officer
Emma Reid [Host]
Women Rock-IT founder
Global Marketing Manager at Cisco
Why Attend?



	- Exclusive Insights: Get up close and personal with the Cisco Dream Team, the brilliant minds who brought tech to life at the Women''s World Cup.

	- Empowerment: Be inspired by a team that champions diversity, showing how women are leading the way in technology

	- Networking: Connect with like-minded students, tech enthusiasts, and professionals in an engaging, virtual environment.

	- Career Inspiration: Explore the vast opportunities in technology and how you can make a significant impact in global events and projects.
Join us as we celebrate the achievements of women in tech and get inspired to carve your path in this exciting field. Let''s rock IT together!
Find a broadcast in your time zone, and register to attend!

