        (120, null, '[]', 'Are You AI Ready?
Let''s find out: Join our 2024 International Girls in ICT Day
Save an animal species with a photograph? Use data for social good? Yes, it''s all possible, thanks to artificial intelligence (AI). Want to find out how? Then you can''t miss International Girls in ICT Day 2024 on April 25. Together with our speakers, we will discover the beneficial power of AI and how we can join in.
Meet Your Speakers
Dr. Tanya Berger-Wolf
Director, Translational Data Analytics Institute
Professor, The Ohio State University
Co-Founder & Director, AI for conservation non-profit Wild Me
Dr. Elizabeth Bondi-Kelly
Professor, University of Michigan
President & Founder, Non-profit for social impact Try AI

