        (133, null, '[]', 'Hello Nguyễn Phạm Thu,

The competition of a lifetime starts on May 2, 2024. Where you—and other alums—who had the spark to train and train hard can compete on the grandest stage of all: the Cisco-Athlon <http://nsmail.netacad.com/MDU5LVZGWi04MzQAAAGSyxpyNz5dP1v154LAxdMVofjDAw-B9u-Q2jWQbmVp6yo-lb-kGstRAgtMJiAtLnOFqXx9pzU=>. Plan to join us for this fun, decathlon-inspired awards adventure where you can test your strength and compete for glory! 

Start warming up, by reading this blog post <http://nsmail.netacad.com/MDU5LVZGWi04MzQAAAGSyxpyN9UuhUZ0qC7mcLTA-JDDjHT_d-vv5UhDVMzb7Xj49ng3d_x1ruwCawCJ9hj6XUcb0qs=> from Laura Quintana, VP and General Manager of Cisco Networking Academy.
Power your learning
New web experience coming
NetAcad.com and SkillsForAll.com will merge later this year. Get ready for your improved learning experience.
Find your discount code
If you earned a discount for Python or JavaScript certification exams, now you can see your discount code from your Skills for All profile. You’ll still get an email, too.
Earn college credit for your certs
Now with approval from the American Council on Education, you can earn three college credits each for the CCST Cybersecurity and CCST Networking certifications.
All about AI
Tech Tools for the Future: Zebras, AI, and Girls in ICT Day
Replay event to learn how AI, animal conservation, and social impact intersect. And catch-up on this interview <http://nsmail.netacad.com/MDU5LVZGWi04MzQAAAGSyxpyNyXapqrSfMZLs6n2tb3zfqsYGWueSoaiYCjKRj4TzriUbeClAtGjMYQZBPyH8TZX3X0=> with Girls in ICT Day speaker Dr Tanya Berger-Wolf.
AI Security Nuggets on Skills for All
New 5-part video series designed to empower you with cutting-edge insights into AI’s role in 
cybersecurity. Featuring cyber expert Omar Santos of Cisco.
Get started in AI!
Dive into AI with three exciting new learning offerings!
1. The Road to Intelligent Machines <http://nsmail.netacad.com/MDU5LVZGWi04MzQAAAGSyxpyN9ov03v-Xpt3UtlKpMtJ-Ao7paD0shT_FI-Ky4rM3fZHDSj4gIBJ1ji9GipYLD99cP4=>
