        (135, null, '[]', 'Have you heard? An upgraded experience is coming later this year!




Cisco Networking Academy is bringing together the strengths of our two platforms, NetAcad.com and SkillsForAll.com, into a fresh, modern web experience to make your learning even better.




To launch this new experience, both NetAcad.com and SkillsForAll.com will be unavailable for 3 full days of planned downtime during August 23-25, 2024. The new experience will be available on NetAcad.com starting August 26, 2024. Learn more <http://nsmail.netacad.com/MDU5LVZGWi04MzQAAAGTHCNVRpMzM8AaqfdhQZReh0Yw0hZ4EIr3YRH-obwD-4MJiupnqM9jb4l2bvIpxrLU4bSAl5M=>.




 Action to take now


	- Download a copy of your Cisco Networking Academy course completion certificates from your NetAcad.com classes today. They will not be available on your profile in the new platform. See how <http://nsmail.netacad.com/MDU5LVZGWi04MzQAAAGTHCNVRuzPAGj8D8y7GX_0cCoDMeBl3CBNWys7qxoLO7KnIxVkisklbhPx-b_3iVHJdd-JsKo=>.
	- Take a peek at SkillsForAll.com for an early preview of how the new experience will look. Consider checking out one of our new AI <http://nsmail.netacad.com/MDU5LVZGWi04MzQAAAGTHCNVRtp2S5vPmy_0koA7j2G77m6aULDrYaYzyBinHSl_uzWerCyyat4XIabkgpyfqnzfnDA=> or Sustainability <http://nsmail.netacad.com/MDU5LVZGWi04MzQAAAGTHCNVRnk19KskF4s0q-pCYHYT59ixVMx1TG3eKpEqgKJCGlDbpUHiZCQxK6dVMYYWOmpKhWc=> modules!






This new web experience is laying the foundation for even more exciting features to come. Watch for more updates as we get closer to August. Thank you for navigating this journey with us.

