[MongoDB Manila #4: AI-Search Workshop powered by MongoDB - 3 September 2024][2]

 MongoDB Manila #4: AI-Search Workshop powered by MongoDB - 3 September 2024
About this Event
Join this session for a journey into modern search capabilities. Delve into the art of full-text search using Atlas Search and Lucene as your compass. As we navigate deeper, discover how to enrich your application and power AI capabilities with semantic search using Atlas Vector Search. Get ready to roll up your sleeves, engaging in a hands-on experience that equips you to transform your user experience. 
Reminders

Don’t forget to bring your fully charged laptop to the session so that you can fully engage in the hands-on experience and get the most out of it.
You are required to complete the intro lab before coming to the meetup.

Registration
Register here to secure your spot. 
Where?
Event Type: In-Person 
Location: 15F Arthaland Century Pacific Tower, 4th Ave, 30th St, Taguig, Metro Manila 
– 
