[Introducing Myself as a New MUG Leader - Hyderabad][5]

 Hello MongoDB Community! 
I’m Chanda Raj Kumar, an Assistant Professor at KL University in Hyderabad, where I teach Python Full Stack and MERN Full Stack Development. I’m also proud to serve as a MongoDB Educator and the Leader of the MongoDB User Group Hyderabad. 
My journey with MongoDB has been deeply fulfilling, both in teaching and practice. I’ve earned certifications as a MongoDB Certified Associate Developer, Certified Associate DBA, Associate Atlas Administrator, and MongoDB Subject Matter Expert. In addition to teaching, I’m actively involved in conducting Skill Week Sessions on MongoDB and organizing workshops to help others harness the full potential of this powerful technology. 
Being part of the MongoDB Community is an exciting opportunity to collaborate, share knowledge, and grow together. As the leader of the Hyderabad User Group, I’m committed to building a vibrant space for learning and innovation around MongoDB. 
Looking forward to engaging with all of you! 
