[A Recap of MUGs in August 2024][6]

 :earth_asia:Looking for a recap of our latest MongoDB User Groups (MUGs)? Every month, all around the globe, members of our community come together to talk tech and all things MongoDB. 
:point_right:Psst! MongoDB is heading out on a world tour to bring the best content directly to you, with stops in Shanghai, Hong Kong, Bengaluru, Delhi/NCR, Mumbai, Berlin, Taipei, London, São Paulo, Paris, and Stockholm. Use code Community50 to register! :point_left: 
Here are some of our latest gatherings. 
:uk:London on July 16th featured talks on building resilient applications with Temporal and integrating MongoDB with Spring. :australia:Brisbane on July 18th showcased advanced CRUD operations and integrating ChatGPT with MongoDB queries. :australia:Sydney on July 18th explored Atlas Stream Processing and local deployments of Atlas Search. 
