[MUG NewYork: Building GenAI applications using MongoDB and Microsoft Azure][4]

 MUG NewYork: Building GenAI applications using MongoDB and Microsoft Azure
 ![image](https://www.mongodb.com/community/forums/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/d/2d8da0383e16cb086b505f1ef4ee4ba9c329a74e_2_690x388.jpeg) 
Join us for an exciting MongoDB User Group (MUG) event where we’ll dive into the latest technologies and trends in Gen AI, LLMs, and MongoDB’s collaboration with Microsoft Azure. 
Participants will have the opportunity to receive MongoDB Swag : comprising of MongoDB Stickers, Socks, and a T-shirt. :tshirt: :socks:  :tada: 
Sessions


Session 1: The Microsoft Gen AI session will explore the cutting-edge advancements in Generative AI, focusing on large language models (LLMs) and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG). This session will highlight how these technologies integrate with MongoDB Atlas, particularly through its powerful features designed to work seamlessly with Microsoft Azure. Attendees will gain insights into the latest innovations, including how MongoDB and Azure...
