        (281, null, '[]', 'Hi Nguyen Pham Thu Ha,


Kudos on progressing further with your specialization and commencing the 
''Frontend for Java Full Stack Development'' course!


This course is designed to pave the way for both beginners and experienced 
programmers towards mastering frontend development. We start with the 
fundamentals of HTML & CSS, delving deeper into JavaScript programming, and 
finally diving into the creation of dynamic web applications with Angular.


A core element of this course is practical, hands-on learning. As such, as 
you progress through the modules, you will encounter numerous opportunities 
to apply what you''ve learned in realistic scenarios.


Our instructors, with their vast experience in Java Full Stack Development, 
are ready to guide you through each module and assist in transforming you 
into a skilled frontend developer.


Best Regards,


Board Infinity


