[MongoDB Atlas Search and Vector Search - Hands-On Workshop][6]

 MongoDB Atlas Search and Vector Search - Hands-On Workshop
:wave: General Info
Hey-hey, Dublin! 
Join us on 7th Nov in the MongoDB office for a journey into modern search capabilities. Delve into the art of full-text search using Atlas Search and Lucene as your compass. As we navigate deeper, discover how to enrich your application and power AI capabilities with semantic search using Atlas Vector Search. Get ready to roll up your sleeves, engaging in a hands-on experience that equips you to transform your user experience. 

Don’t forget to bring your fully charged laptop to the session so that you can fully engage in the hands-on experience and get the most out of it.
You are required to complete the intro lab before coming to the meetup: Intro Lab | Intro Lab

:trophy: Rewards: 
