A proper cloud platform must hold to certain characteristics that are necessary for the success of any business or application depending on its infrastructure and services. There are 5 main abilities that any cloud platform must provide for the given user so that he is able to depend fully on the cloud. 
Availability – The user’s ability to ensure a service remains available (Highly Available HA). 
Scalability – The user’s ability to grow rapidly without restriction. 
Elasticity – The user’s ability to shrink and grow to meet his demands. 
Fault Tolerance – The user’s ability to prevent failure. 
Disaster Recovery – The user’s ability to recover from any failure (Highly Durable DR). 
