### Popular Topics

[Harry Swan - Edinburgh MUG Leader][2]

 Hello everyone, 
I’m Harry Swan, and I’m excited to introduce myself as the new leader of the Edinburgh MongoDB User Group :scotland: 
As the CTO and co-founder of Cademy, I focus on creating a platform that supports course and workshop providers, with MongoDB as our primary database. I have nearly eight years of experience working with MongoDB and I look forward to sharing my insights and, more importantly, learning from all of you. 
I look forward to launching the Edinburgh MUG and fostering a vibrant local community. Currently, I’m in the process of securing a venue and speakers for our inaugural meeting, which I aim to kick off at the beginning of 2025. 
If you have any suggestions, ideas, or would be interested in hosting or speaking at one of our events, I’d love to hear from you! 
Feel free to connect with me on LinkedIn. 
Looking forward to an exciting journey together! 
Best, 
Harry
