[Mumbai MUG: Harnessing MongoDB Change Streams & Real-Time Streaming][3]

 Mumbai MUG: Harnessing MongoDB Change Streams & Real-Time Streaming
 ![MUG November24 banner](https://www.mongodb.com/community/forums/uploads/default/optimized/3X/0/6/06c8846514a59203c577b8b40e91018fb60e51ec_2_690x388.jpeg) 
MongoDB User Group Mumbai is thrilled to announce its next meetup: Mumbai MUG: Harnessing MongoDB Change Streams & Real-Time Streaming! :tada: 
Join us on 30th November 2024 at ITM Andheri for an exciting day of learning, networking, and fun. This event will feature two insightful technical sessions, a quiz to test your MongoDB knowledge, and plenty of opportunities to connect with fellow MongoDB enthusiasts over lunch. :pizza::gift: 
Whether you’re a beginner or a seasoned MongoDB user, this meetup is the perfect opportunity to dive deeper into real-time data handling and streaming with MongoDB! 

