[Aleksa Lukovic - New MUG Belgrade Leader][6]

 Hello everyone, 
My name is Aleksa, and I am excited to join MUG Belgrade as a co-leader. I work as a freelance AI/ML Engineer and graduated with a degree in Computer Science from the University of Belgrade. 
MongoDB is my go-to database for both freelance projects and my personal startups. I truly appreciate MongoDB’s generous free tier and its developer-friendly environment. 
A big thank you to my dear friend @NeNaD for inviting me to this community. I’m sure we’ll accomplish great things together and have a lot of fun along the way. 
Feel free to connect with me on LinkedIn: Aleksa Luković - Upwork | LinkedIn 
Looking forward to being part of this community and meeting amazing people! 
Best regards, 
Aleksa
