        (351, null, '[]', 'Hi Nguyen, 

A new generation of AI-enriched applications is set to transform business. Learn how they work and what they could do for your business.

Whether you’re a technical leader or a software developer, this primer on generative AI <https://em.mongodb.com/MTQ5LUNCSi0xMzYAAAGXnctcvcFHLDdmA2UZ_snT1WzGMYyTH8WwfpkFiKNeeRyTgFrT5bZa5NkTs97ax3aNtywxoSk=> will provide the background you need to understand the technology and make decisions about your company’s use of it. You’ll learn:



	- How gen AI differs from machine learning
	- What a large language model (LLM) does
	- How businesses can use retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) to build powerful, personalized experiences
	- The role of data in gen AI
View the primer <https://em.mongodb.com/MTQ5LUNCSi0xMzYAAAGXnctcvcFHLDdmA2UZ_snT1WzGMYyTH8WwfpkFiKNeeRyTgFrT5bZa5NkTs97ax3aNtywxoSk=>
Cheers, 
 The MongoDB Team
Copyright © 2024 MongoDB, All rights reserved.
 
1633 Broadway Floor 38, New York, NY 10019

