        (357, null, '[]', 'Hi Nguyen, 

Commercial and open source large language models (LLMs) are advancing at breakneck speed, and developers are already building modern generative AI-powered business applications. But getting from prototype to production requires applications be informed with accurate, up-to-date data specific to your business and deployed at scale with the right security controls.

Read our blog post <https://em.mongodb.com/MTQ5LUNCSi0xMzYAAAGX5eQqXCHqd29s1IU992jl3QFVjR8F0xWpoLHx5xJ_eIGF9o0dVjIeIPxdYIC4oO0tU9hUMXU=> to learn how you can build smart, production-ready AI apps with MongoDB Atlas, our fully managed multi-cloud suite of database services. We provide resources to help you:



	- Build a gen AI-enriched chat app with your proprietary data
	- Use Atlas Vector Search with LangChain and OpenAI
	- Generate predictions directly in Atlas with MindsDB AI Collections
	- Integrate HuggingFace transformer models into Atlas with Atlas Triggers



See why more than 140K developers start using MongoDB every month. Get your free Atlas cluster today. <https://em.mongodb.com/MTQ5LUNCSi0xMzYAAAGX5eQqXETFfn6VAMoT3t1NjQAViT6o75y5k_vDWxlk1Nv5yKeyexw_78sn0edN-pDR4qcAolc=>
