        (371, null, '[]', 'Hi Nguyen,

Vector search is a key element for building generative AI-powered business applications. It’s what enables you to enrich large language models (LLMs) with data from your own operational database, and it’s available in MongoDB Atlas, our fully managed multi-cloud suite of database services.

Here are some great learning resources to get you started:


	- Atlas Vector Search in 3 Minutes <https://em.mongodb.com/MTQ5LUNCSi0xMzYAAAGYCfDT4xpyIiSb2PnazJSVVRdDWqzXTNV4b9k8vct60chDoCG713jqK8hT13wQYgKpX9nYqZ0=>: Here’s vector search in a nutshell from Ben Flast, Director of Product Management.
	- MongoDB Atlas Vector Search <https://em.mongodb.com/MTQ5LUNCSi0xMzYAAAGYCfDT4pHgJ6JfmXd6a_0mLCAENfnBoFrbUPKmhRVzCxMvWXGviPd9QhRZHxpS4_1_vJ-4-Zw=>: This overview details key use cases, integrations, and capabilities we’ve built into Atlas Vector Search.
	- Atlas Vector Search Quick-Start Guide <https://em.mongodb.com/MTQ5LUNCSi0xMzYAAAGYCfDT4ug5KtiSravQvx68TVIQt8mrmWIiWuflDq-VBJpoZ8OBDuxU2Ew1ubfsahWFOAI9dD4=>: Ready to try Atlas Vector Search? Head over to the docs page now.



