        (387, null, '[]', 'Hi Nguyen,

Readily available LLMs and frameworks like OpenAI and Langchain make creating gen AI-powered apps that work with your operational data not just a possibility, but a requirement going forward.

These tutorials will walk you through the process of using MongoDB Atlas Vector Search to create modern generative AI-powered business apps:



	- “Leveraging MongoDB Atlas Vector Search with LangChain <https://em.mongodb.com/MTQ5LUNCSi0xMzYAAAGYUgnAx5cwV-PGR-cdVVcKhkmEp2wuYyOMw_GDFLsBpC0psOBHgsIEe8WTA8C854dxQRmfFuk=>” describes how to use Langchain and OpenAI with MongoDB Atlas Vector Search.
	- “Leveraging OpenAI and MongoDB Atlas for Improved Search Functionality <https://em.mongodb.com/MTQ5LUNCSi0xMzYAAAGYUgnAxxh6X3OaZeuq6WQPGoPYPXthcRrtNP9R6P1WpxPsgW4KhV8stKOxSMX0tGbOvBhuquw=>” tells you how to improve search relevance and user satisfaction.
	- “RAG with Atlas Vector Search, LangChain, and OpenAI <https://em.mongodb.com/MTQ5LUNCSi0xMzYAAAGYUgnAxwQ-2b_LDVPP9hERLJTZR9XaDxQYYa8x3Xw_2y1WV_Yp15iwf7QswxaZwxkFiSEODas=>” describes the limitations of LLMs and demonstrates how retrieval augmented generation overcomes them to bring gen AI into the realm of business operations.



See why more than 140K developers start using MongoDB every month. Get your free Atlas cluster today. <https://em.mongodb.com/MTQ5LUNCSi0xMzYAAAGYUgnAx9dwOIs3z2Z4g4mgDEpjaDTPSbs56vjzwBcvP3L7OPPz4JYDrT-RNW2Ajxogj1RzxNc=>
Get started now <https://em.mongodb.com/MTQ5LUNCSi0xMzYAAAGYUgnAx9dwOIs3z2Z4g4mgDEpjaDTPSbs56vjzwBcvP3L7OPPz4JYDrT-RNW2Ajxogj1RzxNc=>
Cheers, 
 The MongoDB Team
