        (428, null, '[]', 'Alternate text ( https://xtensio.com/?utm_campaign=Welcome+%281%2F25%29&utm_content=Working+with+clients&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )Hey Nguyen Pham Thu Ha (K18 HCM),,

Sharing or collaborating with clients should be effortless—without messy email chains, lost attachments, or version confusion.

Xtensio makes it simple and professional—all while keeping your brand front and center.

Here’s how to stay in control while working efficiently with clients:

👥 Who Gets Access? Team Members vs. Guests

Team Members – Have full dashboards, can create their own folios, and can be set to view-only or edit access per folio.

Guests – Have limited access. They see a clean, distraction-free dashboard with only the folios or workspaces you’ve shared with them. They cannot create new folios.

📌 The Best Ways to Share Work with Clients

1 - Share a Quick Folio Link (No Login, View-Only)

Need to share a proposal, report, or update fast? Just send a live link.

Clients can view it instantly—no logins, no downloads.
Public links aren’t searchable online—only those with the link can access them.
Mobile-friendly—clients can check it out anytime, anywhere.

2 - Share an Entire Workspace (No Login, View-Only)

Working on multiple deliverables? Send one workspace link so clients can view everything in one place.

3 - Invite Guests to a Folio (Login Required, View-Only or Edit Access)

Need client feedback? Give them edit access so they can add comments or make updates.

Want control? Set them as view-only.

4 - Invite Guests to a Workspace (Login Required, View-Only or Edit Access)

Best for ongoing projects where clients need access to multiple folios.
Set custom permissions per folio—some view-only, some editable.
Guests see a minimal dashboard—only what you’ve shared with them.

🎨 Make It Yours: Branding, Security & Tracking

Your Branding, Everywhere – Upload your logo, and it’ll appear on logins, dashboards, shared links, and the editor.

Engagement Analytics – See who viewed your folios, how long they spent, and what sections they engaged with.

Instant Access Control – Remove a guest or unpublish a link, and access is instantly revoked.

Switch Permissions Anytime – Easily change someone from view-only to edit (or vice versa) without re-inviting them.

Extra Privacy Controls – Add a password or disable public sharing when needed.

This is the easier, more professional way to work with clients—keeping everything clear, polished, on-brand, and always up to date.

Want to see how it all works? Let’s hop on a quick call, and I’ll walk you through it.

👉 ( https://calendly.com/xtensio/30-min-with-xtensio?utm_campaign=Welcome+%281%2F25%29&utm_content=Working+with+clients&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )Book a Free 30-Min Walkthrough ( https://calendly.com/xtensio/30-min-with-xtensio?back=1&utm_campaign=Welcome+%281%2F25%29&utm_content=Working+with+clients&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )

Talk soon!

 

Alper Cakir
Founder, Xtensio

