        (472, null, '[]', 'Hey, We’d love to help you explore one of our most powerful features — our native Supabase integration that enables you to add login, store data, add API keys, and more.

Here’s a quick setup guide:
* Go to a lovable project of yours and click "Supabase"
* Follow the flow to create & connect a Supabase account and project
* In Lovable you can click supabase again to verify that it is connected
* Once connected, you can for example tell Lovable to add login functionality to your app We highly suggest checkout out our more detailed supabase setup guide ( https://docs.lovable.dev/integrations/supabase ) if you''re feeling unsure of this process. Let us know if you have any questions or feedback. We can’t wait to see what you build!

Best, 
Anton

