        (475, null, '[]', 'Hey,
Have you checked out Lovable Launched ( https://launched.lovable.app/ ) yet? our platform where you can showcase your app to reach thousands of potential users + discover apps others have built.
To spark some inspiration, here are a few standout projects from our community:

Innovative SaaS apps:
* Wiktok ( https://wiktok.gptengineer.run/ ) (TikTok meets Wikipedia!) - A SaaS with API integrations
* Renamify ( https://renamify.co/ ) - AI-powered Micro SaaS
* Emoji Riddles ( https://emoji-riddles.lovable.app/ ) - A fun guessing game
* BluePrintA ( https://blueprinta.xyz/ ) - Simplify Product Development
* Aneta ( https://www.producthunt.com/posts/aneta ) (Product Hunt) - AI agents to supercharge HR and workplace engagement
* Armazenai ( https://armazen.ai/ ) - Transforming logistics in Brazil
* Wildcard AI ( https://wild-card.ai/#integrations ) (YC) - Intelligent tool selection API for AI agents
* RaiseFlow ( https://raiseflow.io/ ) - An investor CRM
Productivity tools and apps that help users & teams solve specific needs:
* Bill Generator ( https://billify-generator.gptengineer.run/ ) – Streamlines billing processes
* Recharts ( https://pdf.gptengineer.run/ ) - A PDF suite powered by PDF-lib
* Social Media Guideline Checker ( https://guideline-guru.gptengineer.run/ ) – Automates social media checks for consistent branding
* Tribbai ( https://t.co/qLplryd4s3 ) - GPTs talking to each other
* Color Wheel ( https://t.co/qgBIQncjbq ) - AI-powered color analysis
* Cherishable ( https://cherishable.lovable.app/ ) - A tool to make videos
* Dummy Forms ( https://dummyforms.lovable.app/ ) - Easily create forms
These are just a few examples showing what’s possible with Lovable. We can’t wait to see what you’ll build — don’t forget to share your creations with our community on Discord ( https://discord.gg/rPw2rSFE2K ).

Keep building, 
Anton

