        (487, null, '[]', 'Hey again,

It’s been a couple of weeks, and you’re already making great strides with Lovable — so why not earn an income while you build? Here are a few ways people in our community is doing just that:* Offer Freelance Projects – Our user Sarah pitched a local restaurant with an outdated ordering system and rebuilt it faster and more affordably than an agency. With Lovable’s tools (like Stripe checkout), she delivered a sleek, modern solution—and landed a happy (paying) customer.
* Build & Monetize SaaS – Multiple Lovable users have launched subscription-based apps that bring in recurring revenue. For inspiration, check out Renamify ( https://renamify.co ) or Aneta ( # ) (both built with Lovable).
* Consulting & Workshops – Harry ( https://www.x.com/harry_aldian ) teaches local businesses how to create efficient web tools using Lovable. By hosting workshops, he generates ticket revenue, fosters innovation, and shares his success story in our blog post ( https://lovable.dev/blog/2025-01-21-from-solo-developer-to-1-million-dream-building-a-thriving-business-with-lovable ).
* Become a Lovable
Partner ( https://lovable.dev/partners ) – It’s the easiest way to connect with clients looking for custom solutions in our community. As a partner, you’ll get priority access to new projects, plus the freedom to build on your own terms.
We’re excited to see how you’ll leverage Lovable to turn your passion into profit. Here’s to building something impactful!Best, 
Anton P.S. Everything you create is yours—feel free to share your projects on X or Reddit. We’d love to cheer you on!

