        (497, null, '[]', 'Hey,

It''s Anton here, creator of Lovable.

Here are some exciting updates for you.

------------------------------------------
Publish your project with a custom domain
------------------------------------------

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
You can now easily connect your own domain to your Lovable app, making it truly yours.
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Here''s is a step by step guide on how to connect a custom domain: docs.lovable.dev/tips-tricks/custom-domain ( http://email.lovable.dev/e/c/eyJlIjoxNjU3MzQsImVtYWlsX2lkIjoiZXhhbXBsZSIsImhyZWYiOiJodHRwczovL2RvY3MubG92YWJsZS5kZXYvdGlwcy10cmlja3MvY3VzdG9tLWRvbWFpbiIsInQiOjE3NDI0MDIyMTZ9/54d6d46ff1305815ec250ed740bfd0aede2f2a970f66080965a472313e4e9ad3 )
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

-------------------------------
Updates to the project settings
-------------------------------

We’ve made some improvement to Lovable’s project settings layout for a more intuitive experience.

You can now find Project Settings in the top left corner of your project page for quicker access and better navigation.

Settings access animation

The monthly credits counter is now in the settings menu for quick access.

Dropdown menu

--------------------------
Other fixes & Improvements
--------------------------

-------------------------------------------------
We''ve also done several reliability improvements:
-------------------------------------------------

* Fixed bug where AI would create new edge functions instead of fixing existing ones
* Lab feature settings are now saved to your user account instead of local storage, ensuring they persist across devices
* Fixed bug causing the live preview window to go out of sync after AI edits
* Fixed Supabase authentication session persistence issues

------------------------------------------------------
Lovable livestream with Make.com team - Thursday 20th
------------------------------------------------------

Want your Lovable app to integrate with Slack, WhatsApp, CRM, email, and more? You can automate it with Make.com!

​In this livestream we are joined by Sebastian Mertens (Head of applied AI) from Make who is going to show us how he is amplifying his Lovable apps with AI powered workflows.

Claim your spot here: https://lu.ma/mgk8y36u

That''s a wrap!
We’re always excited to hear from you. Share your thoughts or ask questions anytime at https://lovable.dev/support

Best,Anton & the Lovable team

Email footer image

Turn ideas into lovable products at Lovable.dev ( https://lovable.dev )

