        (552, null, '[]', 'Congratulations on finishing the Advanced Writing course! You’ve done a 
great job!


If you’re interested in improving your English skills further, we welcome 
you to take another specialization, such as Learn English: Advanced Grammar 
and Punctuation, Learn English: Intermediate Grammar, or The Pronunciation 
of American English. Look for all of these on the Coursera website.


If you’re interested in furthering your studies, UCI is offers a wide 
variety of online teacher-led courses in English and Teaching English as a 
Second Language, as well as hundreds of courses in business and other 
professional fields. For more information about those, contact us at 
ip@ce.uci.edu.


And if you’re really motivated to learn more, consider coming to the 
University of California, Irvine to study in one of our English language or 
professional certificate programs. You can find information about that on 
our website: https://ip.ce.uci.edu/.


If you’ve enjoyed the course, Coursera would love to hear from you! 
Finally, if you don’t mind, please tell your friends and family about this 
course. I would love to see them online in the future.


Best of luck to you in your English studies!


Sincerely,


