Welcome!  
Let''s launch your your first project in Jira


 We unlocked the best of Jira with premium features for you for free. Over the course of your trial, we''ll send you a series of Jira quick tips and resources to kickstart your project with ease.



 And if you want to invite teammates to collaborate with, Jira''s always free for up to 10 users.
 

https://net07-team3.atlassian.net/jira/your-work 
Start with Jira
 

https://net07-team3.atlassian.net/jira/your-work 


 Smash any project in 3 easy steps:
 

Break down your work

 Create work items to build your team''s to&#8209;do list. You can rename these to be bugs, tasks, campaigns &ndash; whatever you want.
 

Link important details

 Add fields to link all the important details, like due dates, assignees, priority, and more. This adds context to your tasks &ndash; important for cross&#8209;functional collaboration.
 

View it your way

 There are four different ways to view and manage work. Use a board or list to see lots of work at once, or use the timeline or calendar to plot work out over months or quarters.
 

Ready to make it all happen?


 Jump into Jira to discover what''s possible. 
 

