🙌
Nicely done!
 
Your first whiteboard is coming together beautifully. Here are some tips to help you master the art of collaborative canvases.
>> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Jogf4d7MAl8

🎨 Say it with text, sticky notes, and connectors
 
Communicating your ideas has never been so easy. Utilize the text, stickies, and connector functions to visualize all of your ideas and plans.
 
Try it now  →
>> https://net07-team3.atlassian.net/wiki/create-content/whiteboard?source=firstwbjourney

 
🚀 Get started quickly with pre-built templates
 
Brainstorming, retrospectives, planning, and prioritization templates – you name it, we got it. Save time by getting started quickly with one of our pre-built templates.
 
Try it now →
>> https://net07-team3.atlassian.net/wiki/create-content/whiteboard?source=firstwbjourney
 🤝 A seamless two-way sync with Jira
 
Easily import Jira issues to visualize your tasks and map out work, or create Jira tickets directly from your whiteboard stickies to turn ideas into action.
 
Try it now →
>> https://net07-team3.atlassian.net/wiki/create-content/whiteboard?source=firstwbjourney

📚 Bring in all the context you need
 
Go ahead and close those extra tabs. Copy and paste links to all of your relevant content to embed them directly into your whiteboard.
 
Try it now →
>> https://net07-team3.atlassian.net/wiki/create-content/whiteboard?source=firstwbjourney

 
Create a whiteboard
>> https://net07-team3.atlassian.net/wiki/create-content/whiteboard?source=firstwbjourney

