 Brainstorm, plan, and action work like never before. With Confluence whiteboards, you can:
 

 -
 
 Brainstorm and plan work freely on an infinite canvas.
 

  
 

 -
 
 Collaborate and edit in real&#8209;time with your team.
 

  
 

 -
 
 Unleash your creativity with easy to use tools like stickies, text, shapes, and line connectors.
 

  
 

 -
 
 Connect your work by referencing work across other tools like Figma, Google Docs, and YouTube.
 


 🎥 
https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Jogf4d7MAl8&t=44s 
See Confluence whiteboards  in action.
 

https://net07-team3.atlassian.net/wiki/create-content/whiteboard 
Make a whiteboard


 
