Teamwork is a few clicks away
 
It''s easier than you think to get started


One of the best ways to support your team is to unblock them from the tedious tasks and let them do their best work. All it takes is 3 easy steps:
 
1. Make sure your project has the right workflows set up (does your board have all the status columns you need?)
 
2. Send invites to everyone who hasn''t been included yet
 
3. Tag yourself or a team member of the tasks that haven''t been assigned to anyone yet

 
Take me there
