        (942, null, '[]', '**The Current**
===============

Product Newsletter | December 2025

Work doesn''t happen in one place. You''re switching between your editor, your canvas, and your team. This month, we''re making it easier to move between them — and bringing new pricing that grows with you.


**🎯****AI prompts that adapt to your diagram**


AI chats now generate context-aware prompts tied to your actual diagram. When you press the AI button, you’ll see suggestions tailored to what you’re building. Use it to:


- 

Extend your diagram using best-next-step prompts


- 

Generate variations (“Propose 2 alternative flows”)


- 

Clarify structure or find missing pieces


It’s like having a diagram-aware copilot that knows exactly where you left off. Give it a try: open any diagram → hit the AI button → pick a suggested prompt.

[ Start a new AI chat](https://f1gxg.r.a.d.sendibm1.com/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ6uvcwCqTl49MOEkYcc3y6Ce/LiWHMIvfycAB)


**⚙️ AI Repair, now more selective and transparent**


AI Repair has gotten much smarter (and more controllable). You can now:


- 

Choose exactly which issues AI should repair


- 

Preview and compare proposed repairs side-by-side


- 

Apply minor fixes or full transformations without losing context


Whether you''re cleaning up indentation or recovering a broken diagram, transparently seeing why and how AI is adjusting your code gives you more trust + control.

[ Create a diagram](https://f1gxg.r.a.d.sendibm1.com/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ72igyQ6pqXp88OXhPVBDnom/lV0ju0qbr0ef)


**Your sequence diagram 🤝 code, staying in sync visually**


It’s the smoothest way yet to move between “what it looks like” and “how it’s written.”


- 

Click on any element in the diagram → we highlight the corresponding code


- 

Click on code → we highlight the node or connection in the diagram


This closes the loop between visual design and structured syntax. Perfect for onboarding teammates, reviewing changes, and understanding complex diagrams at a glance. Why it matters:


- 

See exactly where your visual changes live in the code


- 

Edit inline or in the code panel without losing your place


- 

Perfect for developers who think in both modes


**And a little preview…**

Flowcharts are next. Soon, you’ll get the same seamless visual ↔ code sync for shapes, branches, and logic paths – making it just as easy to navigate flow-based logic as your sequences.

[ Try synced editing](https://f1gxg.r.a.d.sendibm1.com/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ7AVl0dNBw1UtsYKqCOITVQu/5demyFHwYx1T)


**👥 Onboard your org in one simple step**********

New users signing up can now join their organization automatically, reducing friction for admins and making onboarding painless.


If your team already uses Mermaid, teammates can connect to the right workspace immediately — no ticket, no manual invite.

[ Create an org](https://f1gxg.r.a.d.sendibm1.com/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ7Q5t53tu6yqRMrv7mAWyufA/aFqCu4WblwI6)


**☝️ Pricing updates – built around real usage**


We’ve rolled out new pricing designed around user value, clarity, and sustainability.


- 

**Basic (formerly Free)**: Your monthly AI limit increases from 5 to 15 – so if you''ve hit your limit before, you can come back and create again.


- 

**Plus (formerly Pro)**: For individuals and small teams who need reliable diagramming without the extras.


- 

**Premium (New)**: Purpose-built for growing teams. Includes SSO, unlimited viewers, and everything in Plus. 


- 

**Enterprise (Improved)**: Custom contracts, dedicated support, and advanced security. Built for organizations with complex needs.


[Talk to us](https://f1gxg.r.a.d.sendibm1.com/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ7Xsx7HAGCSWD71iGZ3eEcHI/okyxJnmXiPHT) if you''re supporting a large engineering org or have any questions.

[ View new pricing](https://f1gxg.r.a.d.sendibm1.com/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ7fg19UQcHwByrBVPLwlUJtQ/i7HeqrEoo1uw)


**🐚 Today''s seashells (small delights we shipped)**


- 

**Auto + Manual modes are now clearer:** navigate to the top of your diagram to let Mermaid position everything automatically, or switch to Manual for precise control.


- 

**Find the right icon in seconds**: Pick icons effortlessly with a more intuitive UI (faster than reading one more Jira ticket).


- 

**Bring diagrams into your IDE without breaking flow**: Use the new Mermaid extension for [Google Anti-gravity IDE](https://f1gxg.r.a.d.sendibm1.com/mk/cl/f/sh/WCPzyXJTZ7nT5BhgyNPrkbLIY8psk1VY/23z04Vse5u1t) to create, edit, and preview diagrams right where you code – no context switching, just pure momentum.


**📌 What to try this week**


1. 

Use the new AI smart prompts to iterate quickly on an existing diagram


2. 

Create a sequence diagram and highlight a diagram node → see exactly where it lives in code


3. 

Invite a teammate and let them join your org automatically


4. 

Test selective AI Repair on a messy diagram
Happy diagramming, 

*The Mermaid Team*

 

[Contact Us](https://f1gxg.r.a.d.sendibm1.com/mk/cl/f/sh/28xHLtxYQ509KP9MIZK4aPUsXiFGI70VT6/6FKAGQavqWsF) | [Documentation](https://f1gxg.r.a.d.sendibm1.com/mk/cl/f/sh/28xHLtxYQ50fUzoV46Wh6sdSycX7s3qau8/8tPSIYORmtnG) | [Unsubscribe](https://f1gxg.r.a.d.sendibm1.com/mk/un/v2/sh/WCPxRrWByckTgNu6zGFOtf8n384l2A4u/4AaWZ-GdWMxb)

 

