Digital Summit
 
Join us for Teamwork in an AI era
 
From power users to empowered teams
 
For organizations to drive measurable AI impact, they need to nail how human+AI teams coordinate, collaborate, and execute at scale.
 
On March 31, Atlassian is bringing together an expert analyst from Forrester, bestselling author and leading organizational psychologist, Adam Grant, and members of the Atlassian Executive Team for a global* digital summit discussing how AI is reshaping work and driving innovation.
 
Register now and walk away with a clear point of view – and practical examples – on how to:
>> https://www.atlassian.com/webinars/enterprise-cloud/teamwork-in-an-ai-era?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_sfdc-campaign_id=701QB00000fxrIUYAY&utm_campaign=P%3Atwc%2AO%3Aclm%2AF%3Aawareness%2AC%3Adigital-summit%2AH%3Afy26q3%2AI%3Aht-registration-send1%2AE%3Acloud%2A_ACM-9329&jobid=107883527&subid=1942065613

* Turn isolated AI wins into measurable enterprise outcomes
 
* Raise the tide for every team, not just a few super users
 
* Embed AI into the way work is coordinated, not bolted on as another "magic button"
 
