March 31, 2026
 
Digital Summit
 
Discover how leaders are scaling AI‑powered teamwork
 
Hear from Adam Grant + leaders at NVIDIA, Forrester, and more.
 
AI is making individuals faster, but most organizations are still struggling to turn those gains into enterprise‑wide outcomes.
 
At our (free) global* Digital Summit,  "Teamwork in an AI era," on March 31, you''ll hear from industry leaders on how to move beyond pilots to real impact, including:
>> https://www.atlassian.com/webinars/enterprise-cloud/teamwork-in-an-ai-era?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_sfdc-campaign_id=701QB00000fxrIUYAY&utm_campaign=P%3Atwc%2AO%3Aclm%2AF%3Aawareness%2AC%3Adigital-summit%2AH%3Afy26q3%2AI%3Aht-registration-send2%2AE%3Acloud%2A_ACM-9332&jobid=107904186&subid=1942065613

* Adam Grant, organizational psychologist and bestselling author, on how AI is reshaping how teams are designed, motivated, and led.
 
* Shivam Khullar, Director of Product and Engineering at  NVIDIA, on turning AI ambition into measurable outcomes.
 
* Will McKeon‑White, Senior Analyst at Forrester, on where Atlassian''s approach fits in the evolving AI landscape.
 
* Liz Fosslien, Atlassian Teamwork Lab, on fresh research about how teams are actually using AI to deliver results.
 
* Atlassian Product Leaders: Tamar Yeshoshua, Sanchan Saxena, and Gunjan Sood, on how we''re integrating AI into a new system of work, from product to people.
 
Register now to join us live or to have a copy of the recording sent to your inbox!
 
Save your spot
