In conversation with Ethan Mollick and Emily Chang

Hear from Atlassian leadership, Emily Chang, and Ethan Mollick on the future of human-AI collaboration. Join a dynamic conversation designed to spark ideas, challenge perspectives, and set the tone for Team ''26.

Emily Chang is one of the leading voices on technology, business, and culture. She travels the world to meet with founders and cultural icons shaping our world and explores what it means to be human in an age of extraordinary technological change.

Ethan Mollick studies the effects of artificial intelligence on work, entrepreneurship, and education. His research has been published in leading journals and his work on AI is widely applied, leading him to be named one of TIME Magazine''s Most Influential People in Artificial Intelligence.

