A comprehensive guide: Jira Product Discovery Premium
 
See the guide
>> https://community.atlassian.com/forums/Jira-Product-Discovery-articles/FAQ-Jira-Product-Discovery-Premium-plan/ba-p/3010997?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=email-4A_EML-20147&jobid=107596147&subid=1942065613&send_date=3/10/2026
 
If your tired of your teams burning time hunting for updates and scrambling to build roadmap presentations, then it might be time for Jira Product Discovery Premium.
 
And to avoid anymore wasted time, our Jira Product Discovery Premium guide covers how to approach implementation across multiple teams (with step‑by‑step videos!) using a real‑world scenario.
>> https://community.atlassian.com/forums/Jira-Product-Discovery-articles/FAQ-Jira-Product-Discovery-Premium-plan/ba-p/3010997?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=email-4A_EML-20147&jobid=107596147&subid=1942065613&send_date=3/10/2026

The best part? It''s written by our Head of Product so you know it''s filled with expert tips and best practices.
 
A sneak peek of what you''ll find inside:
 
✅ Multi-team project architecture – how to balance team autonomy with company‑wide standardization
 
✅ Cross‑project roadmaps – get visibility across all teams in one unified view
 
✅ Custom app hierarchies – connect opportunities → solutions → experiments across discovery projects
 
✅ Global fields strategy – when to standardize vs. when to give teams flexibility
 
See the guide
>> https://community.atlassian.com/forums/Jira-Product-Discovery-articles/FAQ-Jira-Product-Discovery-Premium-plan/ba-p/3010997?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=email-4A_EML-20147&jobid=107596147&subid=1942065613&send_date=3/10/2026
 
