        (1009, null, '[]', 'Ever wondered how AI tools actually work?

We created a completely free course on large language models to help you understand what’s happening behind the scenes – and how you can build with these systems yourself.

Mastering Large Language Models is a hands-on course where you learn by building directly inside PyCharm.

In the course, you’ll learn how to:
&#x2714; Understand how LLMs process and generate text.
&#x2714; Fine-tune models for specific tasks.
&#x2714; Build AI systems that work with real data.
&#x2714; Create applications using retrieval and vector databases.

&#x1F449; Take the course >>> https://academy.jetbrains.com/course/28816?utm_source=marketo&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=general&utm_content=newsletter

<p>Keep building,<br><strong>JetBrains Academy</strong></p> <p>Make it happen. With code.</p>
