        (1010, null, '[]', 'Hi Nguyen Pham Thu Ha (K18 HCM),


Board Infinity is hosting a LIVE Webinar on Future-Proofing Your Developer 
Career (2026), designed to help you stay ahead in an AI-driven tech 
landscape.


AI isn’t just changing development - it’s redefining it. The real question 
is: will you adapt… or lead?


In this session, you’ll learn:


      * AI-first development workflow (idea → deployment)


      * Skills that will grow vs. become outdated


      * How to approach AWS, system design & cloud strategy


      * A clear 90-day roadmap to realign your career


Speaker: Jayaprakash Vattikundala, AI Research Scientist


Date: 25th April (Saturday) | 11:00 AM – 1:00 PM IST


