        (1016, null, '[]', 'Atlassian
 
May 5‑7, 2026
 
Anaheim, CA and online
 
Inspire your inner builder
and lead like a founder
 
Register now
>> https://events.atlassian.com/team?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_content=K%3Aevent%7CH%3Ain-person%7CN%3Ateam_26%7CP%3Aagnostic%7CO%3Aevent-marketing%7CF%3Apre-event%7CC%3Aevent-home%7CQ%3Aagnostic&utm_context=701qb00000tzh4byar&event_id=288640&utm_campaign=ACM-11653_closing_keynote_ACM-11653&jobid=108012784&subid=1942065613
  
Everyone can lead with a founder mindset – at any scale. That''s what Atlassian CEO and Co‑Founder Mike Cannon‑Brookes and Reddit Co‑Founder and Seven Seven Six investor Alexis Ohanian believe.
 
In the Team ''26 Closing Keynote, Permission to build: hardwiring a founder mindset into the enterprise, they''ll share their founder journeys and experiences – from backing the "iconoclasts" who changed the trajectory of their businesses to empowering teams to move faster, think bigger, and trust their inner builder.
 
You''ll walk away with strategic advice on how any leader – from garage start‑up to global powerhouse – can foster a culture of continuous reinvention.
 
