        (1017, null, '[]', 'Everything you can build on desktop, now in your pocket...  

Lovable Logo

Lovable Logo ( https://lovable.dev/?utm_source=cio&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=upsell&utm_content=applaunch&utm_campaign=Lovable+App+Launch+30-90+D&utm_content=Lovable+App+Launch&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )

The Lovable mobile app is here

( https://lovable.dev/?utm_source=cio&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=upsell&utm_content=applaunch&utm_campaign=Lovable+App+Launch+30-90+D&utm_content=Lovable+App+Launch&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )

Hey there,

We just launched the Lovable mobile app – everything you can build on your computer, now in your pocket. Start a project on your laptop, refine it from the bus, or capture that 2am idea before it slips away.

What''s possible on mobile:

* Queue prompts on the go – stack ideas as they come and let Lovable work through them
* Get notified when it''s done – review builds and keep moving, no need to watch and wait
* Pick up where you left off – switch seamlessly between phone and computer

( https://apps.apple.com/us/app/lovable-build-with-ai/id6757471107?utm_campaign=Lovable+App+Launch+30-90+D&utm_content=Lovable+App+Launch&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )

​

( https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=dev.lovable.build&utm_campaign=Lovable+App+Launch+30-90+D&utm_content=Lovable+App+Launch&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )

Keep building,

The Lovable Team

