New this year! Join us May 7, 12:30 p.m. at Team ''26 for a live recording of "Masters of Scale" – the acclaimed podcast exploring how influential leaders build and grow transformative companies.
 
WaitWhat CEO Jeff Berman sits down with RJ Scaringe, Founder and CEO of Rivian (and an Atlassian customer), for a candid conversation on innovation, leadership, and the realities of scaling a mission‑driven business.
 
Meet the cast
 
Jeff Berman
 
Public defender, Chief Counsel to US Senator Chuck Schumer, MySpace leader, digital media manager at the NFL, and now the CEO of WaitWhat – Jeff Berman brings his wealth of experience to insightful conversations with iconic business leaders as the co‑host of "Masters of Scale."
 
RJ Scaringe
 
RJ Scaringe founded Rivian in 2009 to redefine the future of transportation through high‑performance electric vehicles. Today, Rivian produces the critically acclaimed R1T, R1S, and the upcoming R2. He is also founder of Mind Robotics, an AI‑enabled industrial robotics company, and co‑founder of ALSO, an electric micro‑mobility company.
 
