        (1029, null, '[]', 'Plus data warehouse connectors, Microsoft 365, and enterprise access controls.  

Lovable Logo

Lovable Logo ( https://lovable.dev?utm_campaign=April+Changelog+Business&utm_content=Lovable+Changelog+prosumer+V2&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )

Lovable Changelog:
March & April 2026

( https://docs.lovable.dev/features/payments?utm_campaign=April+Changelog+Business&utm_content=Lovable+Changelog+prosumer+V2&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )

A lot has shipped since our last email. Read the full release ( https://docs.lovable.dev/changelog?utm_campaign=April+Changelog+Business&utm_content=Lovable+Changelog+prosumer+V2&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io ) → or keep scrolling for the highlights.

GET MORE CUSTOMERS

Get paid — built into your workspace

Lovable Payments lets your team add subscriptions, one-time purchases, and membership tiers to any app using the built-in Stripe or Paddle integrations. Lovable handles the account setup, webhooks, and subscription data. Set up a live test checkout in minutes and go live the same day. Available on paid plans.

Learn more → ( https://docs.lovable.dev/features/payments?utm_campaign=April+Changelog+Business&utm_content=Lovable+Changelog+prosumer+V2&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )

CONNECT THE TOOLS YOU ALREADY USE

Google Workspace, Microsoft 365, and more

Your apps can now integrate with the tools your team already runs on. Google ( https://docs.lovable.dev/integrations/google-workspace?utm_campaign=April+Changelog+Business&utm_content=Lovable+Changelog+prosumer+V2&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io ) Workspace brings in Gmail, Drive, Docs, Sheets, Slides, and Calendar. Microsoft 365 ( https://docs.lovable.dev/integrations/microsoft?utm_campaign=April+Changelog+Business&utm_content=Lovable+Changelog+prosumer+V2&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )adds Outlook, Teams, OneDrive, Word, Excel, PowerPoint, and OneNote. You can also connect to services like Twilio, Telegram, Linear ( https://docs.lovable.dev/changelog?utm_campaign=April+Changelog+Business&utm_content=Lovable+Changelog+prosumer+V2&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io#app-connectors-twitch-twilio-linear-telegram-and-contentful ), and HubSpot 
( https://docs.lovable.dev/integrations/hubspot?utm_campaign=April+Changelog+Business&utm_content=Lovable+Changelog+prosumer+V2&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io ) through shared connectors — and send transactional emails directly from your app.

Learn more → ( https://docs.lovable.dev/integrations/introduction?utm_campaign=April+Changelog+Business&utm_content=Lovable+Changelog+prosumer+V2&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )

MAKE SENSE OF YOUR DATA

Connect your data warehouse directly

Your apps can now query BigQuery, Snowflake, and Databricks directly — no custom backend needed. Run SQL, build dashboards, and surface the data your team already trusts, all from inside a Lovable app. BigQuery supports SQL and schema exploration. Snowflake connects to warehouses, databases, and schemas. Databricks adds SQL queries, cluster management, and Unity Catalog access.

Learn more → ( https://docs.lovable.dev/changelog?utm_campaign=April+Changelog+Business&utm_content=Lovable+Changelog+prosumer+V2&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io#data-app-connectors-bigquery-databricks-snowflake )

NO MORE TECHNICAL DEBT

( https://docs.lovable.dev/features/generate-files?utm_campaign=April+Changelog+Business&utm_content=Lovable+Changelog+prosumer+V2&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )

Run code. Export files. Ship without blockers.

Lovable can now run code and generate downloadable files directly in chat. Analyze data, produce exports, and send transactional emails from your app — all without leaving the project. On Enterprise plans, code execution runs without modifying your project.

Learn more → ( https://docs.lovable.dev/features/generate-files?utm_campaign=April+Changelog+Business&utm_content=Lovable+Changelog+prosumer+V2&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )

SHIP WITH CONFIDENCE

Enterprise controls, built in

New controls give workspace admins the governance they need without slowing teams down. Groups organize members and manage access across projects, folders, and published apps — with SCIM sync from your identity provider. Granular publishing shares apps with specific groups or individuals instead of the whole workspace. Connection access controls restrict integrations by user, protecting all linked projects automatically. Auth policy locks down sign-in methods across every project centrally. SAML 2.0 SSO adds enterprise auth to any app you ship — works with Okta, Azure AD, and OneLogin. Audit logs now include improved search, filtering, and human-readable context.

Learn more → ( https://docs.lovable.dev/features/security?utm_campaign=April+Changelog+Business&utm_content=Lovable+Changelog+prosumer+V2&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )

SHIP FASTER, EVERY TIME

Your team''s agent, always in context

Give the agent persistent context about shared projects through workspace knowledge, so it always builds from the right foundation. New team members land in the right projects automatically from day one — no manual setup needed.

Learn more → ( https://docs.lovable.dev/features/workspace?utm_campaign=April+Changelog+Business&utm_content=Lovable+Changelog+prosumer+V2&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )

That''s the short version. For the full picture, hit the button below.

Read the full release ( https://docs.lovable.dev/changelog?utm_campaign=April+Changelog+Business&utm_content=Lovable+Changelog+prosumer+V2&utm_medium=email_action&utm_source=customer.io )

Keep building,

