----------------------------
Make the most out of DataLab
----------------------------

 

1

Start from a template or dataset
--------------------------------

Access our curated library of templates ( https://www.datacamp.com/datalab/templates?utm_source=customerio&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=250529_1-nurture-t9_2-b2c_3-all_4-na_5-na_6-nurturev3_7-ws_8-emal-ci_9-na_10-bau_11-email&utm_content=auto ) and datasets ( https://www.datacamp.com/datalab/datasets?utm_source=customerio&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=250529_1-nurture-t9_2-b2c_3-all_4-na_5-na_6-nurturev3_7-ws_8-emal-ci_9-na_10-bau_11-email&utm_content=auto ) to start your next data analysis.

