        (1056, null, '[]', 'Use Cursor to plan, design, build, and review.  

Hi Nguyen Pham Thu Ha,

Writing code is just one part of building great software. Cursor has tools for every stage of the software development lifecycle.

Plan

Plan mode ( https://cursor.com/docs/agent/modes#plan ) lets Cursor research your codebase, ask clarifying questions, and generate a plan you can review and refine before building.

Plan mode in Cursor

Design

The Browser tool ( https://cursor.com/docs/agent/browser ) gives Cursor control over a web browser. Get real-time visual feedback as you modify your site’s layout and style.

Browser tool in Cursor

Develop

MCP ( https://cursor.com/docs/context/mcp ) enables Cursor to connect to external tools and data sources. Create PRs with GitHub MCP or get data insights with Databricks MCP.

Linear MCP in Cursor

Browse MCP directory ( https://cursor.com/docs/context/mcp#servers )Review

When your PR is ready, use Bugbot ( https://cursor.com/docs/bugbot ) for AI code review that can detect even the hardest logic bugs with a low false-positive rate.

Bugbot for AI code review

Try Bugbot ( https://cursor.com/dashboard?tab=bugbot )
We’re excited to see what you build next! Tag us on X ( https://x.com/cursor_ai ) to share what you’re creating.

Best,
Cursor Team

The best way to code with AI.

To opt out of future emails, click unsubscribe ( https://track.customer.io/unsubscribe/dgT_pwsBAIrH-SWJx_klAZ4ml7prL9WDjcVMTI7E_Q== ).

