Hi valued customer,
 
We recently notified you about a change to how we will use customer data to deliver enhanced AI capabilities that can unlock greater value across your organization. Since then, we''ve been gradually rolling out new in‑app settings that give you full control over data contribution based on your organization''s requirements.
 
Today, we''re notifying you that your data contribution settings are now available in Atlassian Administration. As a reminder, your experience may differ from what is described in our public documentation because your organization has been granted the highest level of available control as a valued enterprise customer.
 
If you manage multiple Atlassian cloud organizations, you may receive additional emails because these are organization‑level settings. The details below apply to the following Atlassian cloud organization(s):
 
* inblue
>> https://admin.atlassian.com/o/dc405b2a-a981-4f9f-a8ec-00621a814c84/overview?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiYTg1MGVlNTItOTNiYy00ZGQwLWE1ZWUtMzQyMDU5ODcyNDNjIiwicCI6InNmbWMifQ
 
