>> https://admin.atlassian.com/o/2a7e168b-79cb-4348-bf66-817963584401/overview?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiYTg1MGVlNTItOTNiYy00ZGQwLWE1ZWUtMzQyMDU5ODcyNDNjIiwicCI6InNmbWMifQ
 

 
You''re receiving this message based on your active plans, including trials, as of May 11, 2026. If you''ve made changes since then, you may see a different experience in Atlassian Administration.
 
How do I get started?
 
* To access your data contribution settings, navigate to Atlassian Administration > Security > Data contribution.
>> https://admin.atlassian.com/?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiYTg1MGVlNTItOTNiYy00ZGQwLWE1ZWUtMzQyMDU5ODcyNDNjIiwicCI6InNmbWMifQ

