>> https://support.atlassian.com/security-and-access-policies/docs/manage-data-contribution-for-your-atlassian-organization/?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=ACM-12865&jobid=108055330&subid=1942065613

Reminder: what is changing?
 
As a reminder, Atlassian is changing how we use metadata and in‑app data to improve our apps and AI experiences for all customers. With richer, more diverse customer data and usage patterns, we can build even more meaningful AI experiences that are genuinely useful in your day‑to‑day, such as more intelligent task suggestions from common assignees to recommended next steps and faster incident resolution with root cause analysis in Jira Service Management.
>> https://support.atlassian.com/security-and-access-policies/docs/what-types-of-data-does-my-organization-contribute/?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=ACM-12865&jobid=108055330&subid=1942065613

Our updated legal terms go into effect on August 17, 2026, giving you 90 days to continue preparing for this change now that your settings are available.
>> https://www.atlassian.com/legal?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=ACM-12865&jobid=108055330&subid=1942065613

You trust Atlassian with some of your most business‑critical work, and we take that responsibility seriously, especially when it comes to keeping your data safe. Atlassian doesn''t use metadata or in‑app data from apps that do not yet have data contribution settings available, such as Loom or Bitbucket. Before we use metadata or in‑app data from any app, we''ll provide settings so you can manage data contribution. In addition to these settings and our existing data protection safeguards, we de‑identify and aggregate contributed data before using it to improve apps for all customers.
 
To prepare for this change, please visit our website for resources, including detailed FAQs and a change management checklist.
>> https://www.atlassian.com/trust/ai/data-contribution?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=ACM-12865&jobid=108055330&subid=1942065613

>> https://www.atlassian.com/trust/ai/data-contribution/faqs?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=ACM-12865&jobid=108055330&subid=1942065613

>> https://dam-cdn.atl.orangelogic.com/CDNLink/AT12MW17.pdf
 
We remain committed to providing the resources and support you need to prepare for this change.
 
If you need additional technical guidance, you can reach out to our Support team at any time.

Learn more
>> https://www.atlassian.com/trust/ai/data-contribution?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=ACM-12865&jobid=108055330&subid=1942065613

