        (1072, null, '[]', 'Dear Nguyen Pham Thu Ha (K18 HCM),


Data is the current currency of modern life: it’s used to train artificial 
intelligence, track your purchases, and determine the quality of 
recommendations you get on your streaming services. Being an informed 
citizen means knowing how data is generated and used. Gaining fluency can 
even serve as the foundation and backbone of careers in fields as 
wide-ranging as public policy and healthcare. Explore courses and series on 
the importance of digging into data and the insights and stories it can 
reveal about the topic you’re trying to understand. 


------------------------------------------


Build Data Literacy 


Not really into the whole numbers game, but want to increase your literacy? 
Understanding Data: Navigating Statistics, Science, and AI is a 
three-course Specialization that lays the foundation for engaging with data 
critically and intentionally. This course series is ideal for those who 
interact with data in their roles but aren’t necessarily executing the 
analysis. The series also explores how machine learning affects data 
consumption and management.


Expand
<https://eventing.coursera.org/redirect/4A8U8__4if7x1mbCrDs1YzdRjf-NixRCME3aFXJFDG_rS61EC48DIDzeLNy_rj7VHKG5quaoajcAfEpojgeJlQ.j-jnBcHQAzcHFpFCAmV9Eg.EbbqEd5s0AJQKeN0zaFJkszAfWNou1P0ug7KXr45GiflUDKs7yVeTMzJ2yPa5zNYCn6EXbXHQogn_aWhfwtnnDS1EznAiuVsHUxuNLKL4hDxMVUdeOWE75YpGjnJHcdmoJZ3P08NAZwuMGu9Af1A_xQ6ch2FvhCi8XPJS1DXPqTAYFr8IEF8t6sRL8j5o_l6z1NA_M_u6yogHChsM8JdftQAuD6kw60e6pfjdf6SKdlIzKGSIKwqPcXCtQrdPheKq1AcKve5JuUxKeqiqtvVY7LwFeBsWEsHWiaSltBL4JKvbabuhBHPzm9ad5V5FtWq2U-uKv1NcqHq2m9srdOFM5S7LxNmfk0US7DrTKZsCsw0XXtMD-AjfMx6lHYwcy6jm_3UgAKmdWHco8jozRrvP0KtRDAmo2UhMZbEbBRMNrj-En_4YNFVnAAtJLG6tRNATpvM3cCSM-9AGCPccIY3OhERsj2C7e5Oht3fCXwuIZkkN519MBQLhM7XEn8BuNAyaDrmL4LyOrWF0LYl1qI-vrLjmwq3CyWDBcplm_gRtCvASc6p8mZeXgkBuNTk284enQnou8MuJWF_qCRsKNWgTCnJaySGdVv0-9-dIyV6srQ77Iox_QsEOdc-xnnHVo6Nj7xNvrmfbNEJHpnelCZHnL3lNbbjCVBLEfI87dMRXSAlo_81FoOIoYSoc7C7Y84Gd-wfVuM0LZkcBFZA2P7e6Sqt80MOCE8RHnsQse-JMJy8FysLjHIc-lI5J65HEtYe> 
your understanding of data. 


------------------------------------------


Analyze Complex Datasets in New Ways 


For those looking to deepen their data analysis abilities with Python, 
Applied Data Science with Python provides hands-on learning to develop your 
skills. Explore popular toolkits such as pandas, matplotlib, and others to 
apply statistical, machine learning, information visualization, text 
analysis, and social network analysis techniques to decipher trends in 
large datasets. 


Broaden your expertise with the accompanying course series, More Applied 
Data Science with Python
<https://eventing.coursera.org/redirect/9pRY2Ltg84V8qDLNCoA9YeR-vpMhQtmsFuQDcrl4e_fGYk_TjOLVnk52dJ-egMTvcC5lVgRgtMLs_xDmtsJS-A.Zx02KYZkArngcPEmz5P2Hw.BFZaG_TdVAV_Td-bzSeaB6W37f01doWokAZGvz0AwSV60ITpMOBpPn2hWjxkLQzJ0-5g5kIwPDr8F6BGKPM_8BL2kmvtAvWyXWpi-aegDnWhG3dhofEfnm5hmJEHBySUvr_kHRXyLmc-xfmjV9iM29wqcDuYP9g04pwOKPrtH1Q-Jwvjv_HqgiK8q-7LoZyBABaax9i8Z6jIDma1dtww5IG4THDxkTaMGmLnJOhHRYmFHIpIza0WtC3g7zUlUioiESpHFKALeIMgEY35g903wtxlooZ1mxUJ_G32v1nONfIqVGXK0cIqeR6OX9U-rgg2hpi7WRMhMc-5zcKgDe9mXtK_VTM7-DAYSSVrAsJUOnHU-rIwsGHJer_nZaBMXPE29k_7n5OHKeussMbJM3IaCmKpZdzVdSRvNaJQoeZpSPL9LLV9_mct2gSXX1topUkUWJNYaROCS5POvAC4NcDiyRnBYnzuJSYC9CSpWwT1HIX0Wq3ER2sbhHigZ83qX9_wOhNyJgtNX0B_bMrS4bQkE8maD2TpfJ20QJlffqPOozY1jTEGxXglFwH9WA7Ox_fUQlcIeMK25ShrE5cfXiPjVOLLPjxb2Y33D8IATOXcTATkpvQC35Q7L_GNveQN4avWUYOXBkEm3kvtkw2Frkiivu1iijDYj75LRKjsxCiDJjmuDfeWxV42wqZYAgdIB32SbIEa4uNfSWC96Y1bUtCFgA> 
