------------------------------------------


Influence Policy through Data 


Data Analytics in the Public Sector with R explores both the technical and 
ethical approaches to data analysis and can be used as a foundation for a 
meaningful career in the public sector. Learn to use R, a powerful software 
environment for statistical computing, data analysis, and data 
visualization. Use real public datasets to gain core data analytics skills, 
moving into more advanced techniques to create insightful visualizations 
for planning and reporting. By understanding how these real datasets 
reflect the lives of real individuals, you can paint a picture that informs 
policy efforts to address today’s largest challenges. 


