Improve Health Outcomes with Data


Terabytes of data are generated by the healthcare field, offering valuable 
insights into population health and wellness. In Data Science for Health 
Research, learn to organize and visualize health data using statistical 
analysis programs, a key skill in public health careers. Explore binary 
outcomes and build logistic regression models using R to analyze and 
predict health data with guided coding practice. 


