        (1079, null, '[]', 'Hi %Nguyen Pham Thu Ha (K18 HCM)%,


AI is evolving beyond chatbots and simple prompts. Today''s AI agents can 
reason through problems, access tools and information, and take action to 
accomplish tasks.


Now you can learn how to build them on Coursera.


Agentic AI Builder™: Setting Up a Functional AI Agent from CertNexus is now 
available.


Designed for software developers, AI engineers, DevOps and MLOps 
professionals, IT practitioners, and other technical professionals, this 
hands-on course teaches the foundational skills needed to design, build, 
test, and deploy autonomous AI agents.


In this course, you''ll learn how to:


      * Set up an agent development environment


      * Configure and interact with large language models (LLMs)


      * Implement agent reasoning loops and workflows


      * Integrate tools and external data sources


      * Add knowledge using retrieval-augmented generation (RAG)


      * Improve agent reliability, safety, and performance


      * Test and deploy functional AI agents


Enroll in Agentic AI Builder™ on Coursera today:


