Lovable Logo

Lovable Logo ( https://lovable.dev?utm_campaign=changelog_may2026_business&utm_content=changelog_may2026_business&utm_medium=broadcast&utm_source=cio )

Lovable Changelog:
What''s new

( https://docs.lovable.dev/changelog?utm_campaign=changelog_may2026_business&utm_content=changelog_may2026_business&utm_medium=broadcast&utm_source=cio )

A lot has shipped this month. Read the full release ( https://docs.lovable.dev/changelog?utm_campaign=changelog_may2026_business&utm_content=changelog_may2026_business&utm_medium=broadcast&utm_source=cio ) → or keep scrolling for the highlights.

BUILD WITHOUT LIMITS

Your builds just got a lot faster

Lovable now spins up subagents in parallel to research, review, and build at the same time. On complex prompts, multiple agents divide the work — so instead of waiting for one long sequential run, you get results faster, with each subagent focused on its part of the job. You can see every step in the activity log, so nothing is a black box. Trigger it automatically on complex builds, or ask for it explicitly.

Learn more → ( https://docs.lovable.dev/features/subagents?utm_campaign=changelog_may2026_business&utm_content=changelog_may2026_business&utm_medium=broadcast&utm_source=cio )

SHIP FASTER, EVERY TIME

( https://docs.lovable.dev/features/skills?utm_campaign=changelog_may2026_business&utm_content=changelog_may2026_business&utm_medium=broadcast&utm_source=cio )

Teach Lovable how you work

Skills are reusable playbooks that capture how you want things done — your copy voice, your release checklist, your output format. Create one from chat, and Lovable loads it automatically when the task matches, or trigger it yourself with / in the chat input. No more re-explaining the same conventions on every project.

Learn more → ( https://docs.lovable.dev/features/skills?utm_campaign=changelog_may2026_business&utm_content=changelog_may2026_business&utm_medium=broadcast&utm_source=cio )

SHIP WITH CONFIDENCE

Your apps are secure before they ship

Lovable now runs automatic security scans before every publish. Basic scan checks row-level security, database access, and dependency vulnerabilities. Deep scan adds a full agentic code review for exposed secrets, unprotected endpoints, and access control issues. Fix findings in one click, or let Lovable auto-fix eligible issues for you.

Learn more → ( https://docs.lovable.dev/features/security?utm_campaign=changelog_may2026_business&utm_content=changelog_may2026_business&utm_medium=broadcast&utm_source=cio )

YOUR BRAND, YOUR URLS

Every app, under your domain

Business and Enterprise workspaces can now publish apps under a shared branded URL pattern. Set one workspace subdomain and every app in your workspace follows it automatically — no more generic lovable.app URLs for client-facing or internal tools.

Learn more → ( https://docs.lovable.dev/features/branded-workspace-urls?utm_campaign=changelog_may2026_business&utm_content=changelog_may2026_business&utm_medium=broadcast&utm_source=cio )

CONNECT YOUR CRM

Build on top of your Salesforce data

The new Salesforce connector lets your apps query and update CRM records directly — accounts, contacts, leads, opportunities, cases, and more. Build support dashboards, pipeline views, and internal tools on top of live Salesforce data without stitching together external APIs.

Learn more → ( https://docs.lovable.dev/integrations/salesforce?utm_campaign=changelog_may2026_business&utm_content=changelog_may2026_business&utm_medium=broadcast&utm_source=cio )

That''s the short version. For the full picture, hit the button below.

Read the full release ( https://docs.lovable.dev/changelog?utm_campaign=changelog_may2026_business&utm_content=changelog_may2026_business&utm_medium=broadcast&utm_source=cio )

Keep building,

The Lovable Team

