DataCamp ( https://www.datacamp.com/ )

Hi Nguyen pham thu ha,

The hardest part of learning is finding the time. DataCamp makes it very easy to learn at your own pace at whatever time is most convenient for you.

Dedicate just 15 minutes today to learning something for free on DataCamp and see how good it feels to learn something new. If you don’t have time right now,
schedule some time on your calendar ( https://calendly.com/data-camp/datacamp-learning-session ) at a time that works best.

Learn for Free ( https://www.datacamp.com/?utm_source=customerio&utm_medium=email&utm_id=21358835&utm_campaign=regnurture )

