        (1121, null, '[]', 'Dear Nguyen Pham Thu Ha (K18 HCM),


A new attack class called Agentjacking disclosed this week achieved an 85% 
exploitation rate across 2,388 organizations by weaponizing the trust 
developers place in AI coding agents. Meanwhile, the EU AI Act’s full 
enforcement provisions for high-risk AI systems arrive on August 2, 2026, 
and Colorado’s comprehensive AI legislation takes effect June 30 — making 
AI governance an immediate compliance deadline, not a future consideration. 
The careers that hold up are the ones built on skills that match this 
moment.


