Jira newsletter

JUNE ''26

Introducing Claude Agent for Jira

Claude Agent for Jira is now on the Atlassian Marketplace. Assign any work item to Claude like you would a teammate, and the agent reads the work context, codes in a secure sandbox, and opens a draft pull request in GitHub for your review. Install it, connect your Anthropic API key and GitHub repo, and start assigning work items to Claude.

Read the blog
>> https://www.atlassian.com/blog/company-news/claude-agent-for-jira?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=jswc-JUNE-round-up_ACM-13808&jobid=108132582&subid=1942065613

Our newest features

Create and manage Jira work items from Slack

The Jira Cloud for Slack app now lets you @Jira in any Slack channel to create, update, and assign work items using natural language, without leaving the conversation. Describe what you need, and Jira reads the thread to fill in the right fields and get work moving. You can even assign work items directly to an agent to kick off execution from Slack.

Read the announcement ➔
>> https://www.atlassian.com/blog/jira/jira-for-slack-app?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=jswc-JUNE-round-up_ACM-13808&jobid=108132582&subid=1942065613

Deep link to your AI coding tool from Jira

With deeplinking in Jira, you can now open your AI coding agent directly from any work item. Pick your tool – Claude Code, Cursor, GitHub Copilot, OpenAI Codex, VS Code, or Rovo CLI – and it already has the full context of your Jira work item. All powered by Atlassian MCP.

Get started now ➔
>> https://www.atlassian.com/blog/development/deeplink-to-your-ai-coding-tool-from-jira?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=jswc-JUNE-round-up_ACM-13808&jobid=108132582&subid=1942065613

Atlassian Rovo MCP app for ChatGPT and Codex

We believe context should stay connected wherever your workflow takes you. The Atlassian Rovo MCP app brings your Jira work items and Confluence pages directly into ChatGPT and Codex – so whether you''re summarizing tickets, drafting docs, or generating code, context from your work is always with you.

Watch demo ➔
>> https://www.loom.com/share/a4da5b7682264a50a231122251772b08?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=jswc-JUNE-round-up_ACM-13808&jobid=108132582&subid=1942065613

Sign up for the next  event

Team ''26 Europe is headed to Amsterdam

Join us 6‑8 October at our biggest European event for human+AI collaboration. Get ready for three days of hands‑on workshops, expert‑led sessions, and networking with industry leaders who can help you get more from Jira and your entire Atlassian stack. Secure your Early Bird spot and save €900 on your pass.

Register now ➔
>> https://events.atlassian.com/teameurope?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_context=701qb00000j7fexyam&utm_content=jira_monthly_roundup_june&event_id=345414&utm_campaign=K%3Aevent%7CH%3Ain-person%7CN%3Ateam_europe_26%7CP%3Aagnostic%7CO%3Aevent-marketing%7CF%3Apre-event%7CC%3Aevent-home_ACM-13808&jobid=108132582&subid=1942065613

The trail to better teamwork starts at Atlassian''s Learning Camp

We''re partnering with our Community Champions to bring Teamwork Collection to 14 cities across 4 continents, showcasing how Jira, Confluence, Loom, and Rovo are redefining teamwork, boosting collaboration, and unlocking AI‑powered potential across your organization. Join us in‑person for guided workshops, camp‑themed swag, and more!

Find your city ➔
>> https://community.atlassian.com/forums/Official-Atlassian-Events/%EF%B8%8F-Sign-up-now-Teamwork-Collection-Learning-Camp/ba-p/3233909?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=jswc-JUNE-round-up_ACM-13808&jobid=108132582&subid=1942065613

Agentic Jira: Feature walkthrough, coding agents, and architecture deep dive

Join this live session to see agentic teamwork in action. Get a walkthrough, learn how third‑party coding agents (like Claude and Copilot) can fit into your Jira workflows, and hear the technical architecture behind it all, plus live Q&A with product experts.

Sign up now ➔
>> https://ace.atlassian.com/events/details/atlassian-atlassian-live-presents-agentic-jira-feature-walkthrough-coding-agents-and-architecture-deep-dive/?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=jswc-JUNE-round-up_ACM-13808&jobid=108132582&subid=1942065613

Our latest resources

Jira admin tips: volume 9

Help your teams move faster. Our 9th edition delivers five ready‑to‑share Rovo prompts that turn sprint data into retro notes, catch dependencies before they bite, simplify technical details for any audience, and more!

Read the tips ➔
>> https://community.atlassian.com/forums/Jira-Cloud-Admins-articles/Volume-9-Rovo-prompts-your-teams-can-use-to-speed-up-everyday/ba-p/3242036?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=jswc-JUNE-round-up_ACM-13808&jobid=108132582&subid=1942065613

