        (1157, null, '[]', 'Dear Nguyen Pham Thu Ha (K18 HCM),


Learning new skills is a fundamental part of life. By combining these 
skills, we can leverage new strengths to advance our careers, land 
interviews, and strengthen our connections with others. We’ve brought 
together some of our highest-rated courses that offer the opportunity to 
combine interconnected skills with your current expertise — to help you get 
to where you want to be in your career and in life. 


For learners who have already completed a course in the series, your 
completion counts towards a full Specialization certificate.


------------------------------------------


Navigate the AI-Era with Confidence 


Enhance your critical thinking, business innovation, and leadership skills 
with AI Literacy for Everybody. Discover how AI tools work and learn 
practical, responsible ways to integrate them into your daily workflow to 
save time and boost productivity.


Learn
<https://link.coursera.org/f/a/bdRM6QfS2uTeQ7YVGw0CNg~~/AAQRxRA~/LGrvhi-D2AaaKq0IY7p1dWpYT2sF5h45OfCTaKsTc21QbCEDTONfwUHuDouT155SVDMwNlPYSH5N_3A89-9nNcrNMXbSX5g7BgHFYysNnQ7VUx57QIKJ62xVbPTd4-U0j7N7ii4nhmTvxJWutarCDz4uieF-IhDsrxWd5pkP-NVylxE1lHszh4OQl6y0ZlKRM27ZYQYr1LlAoPYskVwpWwNMZa8_5uWkcTrIwEzXPtIM2baYhG2bIp-VaPIJdXjmk2KCvqKT44M3WcKedQB720qjSifGWYiuL1JqfO0poW3pLm8YSOrIwj96RnURzDbdYTT55mkkVbUDPfcBg7HxbQ~~> 
the AI essentials.


------------------------------------------


Lead from any Position


True leadership isn''t about a title, it''s about connection. Master the 
psychology of persuasion, build cross-functional trust, and learn how to 
rally teams around your ideas, no matter your role, with Influencing People 
without Authority.


Grow
<https://link.coursera.org/f/a/vo5VUM2RNYy0UcOwjST71A~~/AAQRxRA~/_ZHnATiwfDfxLh8voedsABZoVvVlBHORMuHgrPtcCYNQWnMl4g7avxVzIPiaQ6Gj9MIRaWfwfxyvGcA9my0Q9DfMDWqtUP_72A7ggKnIlUSvbULuNX9_A1W8uCIjtIu2rjGpwvHFpeNZRHcS_pE99DJIB5tdCggLUJorgwdQb0xbC5U_t0my0b-EyEiamFXenHwVzcQ4AdjTjnaaMndGpKMFBGbJE1ntdZLO3Hb85UpZ2c4wl_dT7YFTeLWEWk_g_j1mEV8k1ZccTkDX-Y6XzZhWMtJzz5iTJlo7eVGffT-iIfIPSQWpmfD7_ZtPMpUZgW86MBdwColiPQ5PlTgZ31u4opCA5uVzlhA04G6WeNv5F9nCP_9rhQkF162sFDaf> 
your workplace influence.


------------------------------------------


Explore Essential Logic Frameworks 


Critical Thinking and Decision Science provides you with the frameworks 
needed to make better decisions. The Specialization combines model 
thinking, computational problem-solving, evidence-based reasoning, and 
practical AI prompting to build your confidence, evaluate risk more 
effectively, and make high-stakes decisions. 


Sharpen
<https://link.coursera.org/f/a/OmUncuwMFMEFUph3xbgAzw~~/AAQRxRA~/MPq3cXMs7W5PbWUEgl8wOfkYa273NCwnH_x-7RZpQcl3TQ1Tvb9b1_QTdLAMfqXuaAS5-cxQynt231yyBV51qPb1Hru_9MLTVIGE24yCPBi0OAp3WBkN8bns1WcE6ILbFIuD5fsrhLnkk5zveD-g8nSZ57BAipsegVMmpg15Uk2ggEcp0c4zLklQtEleV84l2MW65kVxoQ2ohtofa_3wk1sHaAaDaKgs93Qt9zgeXkRPSeox3gCtLAgC_vUKdNjACPzJXK9JIedKTe7el2_rt-jOs6OgBQjy7P5IUq-g4-0xpBKm5PJVDVm_71fbj3vF9pIF8IvkmSdbm-M7I414cvcp7e9zzDbxR6eJCaQjXTjLHMmYr7ZoZXIHJWZj1Oev> 
your critical thinking.


------------------------------------------


Drive Meaningful Community Change


Advocate for systemic progress with Social Impact & Public Policy. Learn 
how to shape policy from both local and national perspectives, drawing on 
multiple perspectives that can help drive positive social change. 


Explore
<https://link.coursera.org/f/a/V4fnVdQKctSp-jfI1CBMHw~~/AAQRxRA~/6lKudBvoFM_PvDuDfGr7pfNp7SpZPC99GkMZxfx96JEMcchQGQ9ZO2cqG7jNGRvie-NUEyrqr_UZcoLSUVDIwgPFqO3808zbvFsYzjXFEgw7G8rr0qXSbGbu3L1F19RLhkbFNKGFwaPbyV214ga7vX5opKu0bAEomRgyeJQhMAZjURojifH-V4PHpeKya-WVmRvMMwSfgZ3FicSxZVX8e451XMSMYyJwvqI-cdKMVQV9fGD1dTXtLDMiM-fsnuBqFD29v-0paMjyMGvm7V4Oy7YMlUqMDarqndT9TSxIWCXHjf1ENJBNiMUn5h12hmsko2FMvMJff46pWeci71yBWRUwTzml7XczUyC8eDdIQM0~> 
pathways for social impact. 


------------------------------------------


Invest in You


It’s all in the title: Personal and Professional Development gives you the 
essential skills, resilience tactics, and career-mapping strategies needed 
to navigate today’s job market and achieve career milestones that matter to 
you.  


Accelerate
<https://link.coursera.org/f/a/vTY5TPzdVeKEgvsC-qoxig~~/AAQRxRA~/i68tQzUVpwRwQQn42X4nR-WW5KGDI_tjkqIf1IjIFWrn6St12Yi6-okBUhsb2lXnsFLGmZ2f5YmwwPa6Ai7ZVdF-az8kP6t_e7sT1pWW7_ZiqXLT4gmK3EpXYTasJB3spEpoZOzqgdFeRQt0XvyDvN-023zzNB4iPy_zPehFmWNIJduuLMzoLLPob44sf21EIlPBnxBtRZqnWqMCKx74mvVv-PBMJs6sTar2t4KQ760hTDGSY_Q6IGBpIDMkv1KIYTOGMKJgDebehJsC7il5jQYMULTM0tptnzHnALtl21JpOD88RO8y5QXfe-XXecc-mQRC4jeeAetdPpvrW06tRP7ZQOZbVg_mmbVfoPluplk~> 
