I guide students through transforming drawn creative ideas into impressive 
3D models. Students learn how design, anatomy, gesture, and finally 
personality come together to create believable, eye-catching character 
designs. We will end with optimized the character for rigging.


This course is made up of recorded lectures that students can watch 
according to their own schedule. We will have deadlines for each step of 
the process.


