        (1210, null, '[]', 'Atlassian
 
How Jira powers AI‑native software development
  
Jira has always been where your team''s work lives. Now it''s where your agents pull context, infer intent, and deliver better code – all while you stay in control of what''s next and when it''s ready to ship.
 
* Plan and orchestrate work with Jira Planner (coming soon) and your coding agent of choice, whether that''s Jira Coding Agent, Claude, Cursor, GitHub Copilot, or Codex (coming soon).
 
* Manage agent activity in the agent sessions view in Jira, where you''ll find what''s in progress, what needs input, and what''s ready to review, all in one place.
 
* Scale confidently with coding agent automations in Jira to execute tasks within guardrails you set, with a full audit trail of agent activity.
 
