inconvenience and frustration you experienced with our product recently. We
completely understand your concerns and take them very seriously.

Our technical team has identified the root cause of the issue and is
actively working on a patch, which will be deployed within the next 24
hours. In the meantime, I have applied a temporary workaround to your
account so you can continue your work without interruption.

We deeply value your business and appreciate your patience as we resolve
this matter. If you have any further questions, please do not hesitate to
reply directly to this email.

Best regards,
