Hello,
 
We recently notified you about a change to how we will use customer data to deliver enhanced AI capabilities that can unlock greater value across your organization.
 
As the August 17, 2026 effective date approaches, we''re sending a final reminder that your data contribution settings are available for review, and our updated legal terms will take effect. These in‑app settings are available in Atlassian Administration and give you full control over data contribution based on your organization''s requirements.
>> https://www.atlassian.com/legal?utm_source=sfmc&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=ACM-15000&jobid=108193138&subid=1942065613
 
If you have already reviewed and configured your data contribution settings, no further action is required. For your reference, we''ve included the details previously shared about this change in the section below.
 
If you manage multiple Atlassian cloud organizations, you may receive additional emails because these are organization‑level settings. The details below apply to the following Atlassian cloud organization(s):
 
* inblue
>> https://admin.atlassian.com/o/dc405b2a-a981-4f9f-a8ec-00621a814c84/overview?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiOTlhY2YzYTMtNWZjYi00ZTMwLTg5M2ItODYzZTZmM2UyMDAzIiwicCI6InNmbWMifQ 

* fams-group3
