Each role comes with real support from our team, a community of fellow ambassadors, and a direct line into what we''re building next. Applications are open through August 14.

Apply to be an ambassador → ( https://community.lovable.app/ambassadors?utm_campaign=384&utm_content=1903&utm_medium=broadcast&utm_source=cio )

Watch your inbox. More is coming this fall, including new build programs and in-person events near you. The hub and newsletter are where you''ll hear about them first!

See you soon!
The Lovable Community team

PS: We''re hitting the road this fall across the US and Europe. More coming soon.

