Our newest features

Stop spinning up agent sessions manually. Build a loop in Jira.

You can now trigger GitHub Copilot, Cursor, and Claude Code straight from Jira Automation. Define a trigger, write a system prompt, and close the loop – Jira invokes your agents automatically with the full work item context already packaged and passed.

