        (1307, null, '[]', 'Invite a teammate to help bring your vision to life

Hi there,

Add a team member:

- Go to expo.dev/accounts/[your-username]/settings/members (https://d2BN2k04.na1.hubspotlinks.com/Ctc/L0+113/d2BN2k04/VXh5lC1V3P1kW4b9d797MJyXRW6phD5r5SngpxN7-7xzl3lcq-W7Y8-PT6lZ3pWW4XCb974-40DSW8V3Sl33FgdfPW6RgLNr4wzjggW5Q3YHM5X52mTW1Lw5Pj1G_LP2W2ynzmm51M5DhW9dYgcj4Ttqm0W2g1zP-5BTk_7W2hKQCG3pz5zyW3ZJ5143BNflqW8dny9s5--mWfW2JzK1N7sKYYnW4jQG615mV_7HW43jxgw2LXtJkN7Fx5P5mCsdLW1Dqn_C943MxXW4M9vJs87csZ0W7STytz5zM2JXW9hLgzv1LjL5_W5sYCJf7HZjKfMLMNgD8bWvgW64jKw6202hKPW7MDwz46B-9cMW2hqF9B225Xw2N6_v1RCGhBCNN7rzDGWTLFMpdC402-04 )
- Click "Invite member"
- Enter their email
- Start collaborating

Once you get a teammate added we see teams following one of two paths...

The slow way:

- You make changes to the app
- Run eas build (15 minutes)
- Send the build link to a teammate
- They download and install
- 20+ minutes until you get feedback

The fast way with Expo Go:

- You make changes
- They scan your QR code
- Testing/feedback in 30 seconds

- The Expo Team

