Learn the essentials of how to adjust lighting and ground shadow settings in Sketchfab’s 3D Editor with this useful guide.

[Create Materials & Textures for 3D Scans](https://sketchfab.com/blogs/community/how-to-create-materials-and-textures-for-photogrammetry/ "How to Create Materials and Textures for Photogrammetry - Sketchfab Blog")
Normals, metalness, bump map! In this tutorial, Dale Utt shows you how to create textures and materials for models produced using photogrammetry.

Art by: [Cleveland Museum of Art](https://sketchfab.com/clevelandart "Cleveland Museum of Art - Sketchfab")

[All Tutorials](https://sketchfab.com/blogs/community/category/tutorial/ "Tutorials - Sketchfab Blog")
There are even more tutorials over on our Blog. If you''re short on time, check out our bite-sized [Sketchfab Tips](https://sketchfab.com/Sketchfab/collections/sketchfab-tips-b5e94e2790384e80a96de0a3f2b596a0 "Sketchfab Tips Collection").


Get Creative
============


[Free Models](https://sketchfab.com/3d-models?date=week&features=downloadable&licenses=322a749bcfa841b29dff1e8a1bb74b0b&licenses=b9ddc40b93e34cdca1fc152f39b9f375&licenses=72360ff1740d419791934298b8b6d270&licenses=bbfe3f7dbcdd4122b966b85b9786a989&licenses=2628dbe5140a4e9592126c8df566c0b7&licenses=34b725081a6a4184957efaec2cb84ed3&licenses=7c23a1ba438d4306920229c12afcb5f9&sort_by=-likeCount "Free Creative Commons Licensed Models - Sketchfab")
