        (1328, null, '[]', 'Developers who build early catch issues before they become blockers

Hi there,

We analyzed thousands of Expo apps. The pattern is clear:

Developers who build within their first 2 weeks are 6x more likely to successfully launch to the App Store.

Why? They catch device-specific bugs early, when fixing them is simple.

Javascript

npm install -g eas-cli

eas login

eas build

