        (1330, null, '[]', 'We’re excited to share that KitBash, the company behind 3D art platforms [KitBash3D](https://r.email1.sketchfab.com/mk/cl/f/sh/28xHLtxYQ4z5Eip6BGpkuVXZ4DQhhNgQYE/kJOsjllLmLDT) and [Greyscalegorilla](https://r.email1.sketchfab.com/mk/cl/f/sh/28xHLtxYQ4zbPJUEwo2NQyg9V7iZHKWVzG/RR8xq4VBfB3r), has acquired Sketchfab and ArtStation. 


Artists and studios use KitBash3D and Greyscalegorilla to access extensive libraries of 3D assets and materials, professional design and animation tools, educational resources, and workflow technology that is integrated directly into leading creative applications. Together, KitBash3D, Greyscalegorilla, Sketchfab, and ArtStation will support artists at every stage of the creative process from bringing ideas to life to sharing their work and building their careers.  


This community is central to what makes Sketchfab great and as part of KitBash we will continue to create opportunities for artists to come together, collaborate, share and learn. There are no changes to how you access or use Sketchfab and your portfolios, models, embeds, and existing workflows will continue to operate as they do today. 


Check out the full announcement over on the [Sketchfab blog](https://r.email1.sketchfab.com/mk/cl/f/sh/28xHLtxYQ4yZ489xPjd8O2OydJ8q7QqL7C/I9qBi6sGp_p-blogs/community/kitbash-acquires-sketchfab-and-artstation). 


We’re grateful to the artists and creators who have shaped Sketchfab over the years, and we look forward to this next chapter with KitBash.


The Sketchfab Team


KitBash LLC, 8605 Santa Monica Blvd, PMB 90726, West Hollywood, CA 90069

