Coming September 22nd, save your seat
 
State of AI SDLC · September 22, 2026 · Digital summit
 
You''re invited to the State of AI SDLC, a digital summit for engineering and product leaders building with AI.
 
Hear from industry leaders across Atlassian, DX, Lovable, and more as they explore how AI is shaping how software gets planned, built, and run.
 
Join us on September 22nd to:
 
* Discover how leading organizations are adopting AI across every stage of the software development lifecycle.
 
* Learn how engineering leaders measure impact, scale adoption, and drive business value.
 
