  "difficulty": "EASY",
  "language": "Java",
  "problemStatement": "The project includes a simple authentication service that validates user credentials against a MySQL database using raw JDBC. The code is intended to retrieve a user record matching the supplied username and password and return true on success. The review should identify security flaws, resource management problems, and hard‑coded secrets, and suggest proper fixes.",
