ith an uninformative subject line, makes it impossible to understand the sender''s intent or the purpose of the attachment. This reflects a significant oversight in professional email etiquette."}}', 495, '2026-07-26 14:12:50.845452', 24369, 'java-backend', 'no-trace-id', '{"emailContext":{"scenario":"","level":"INTERN","candidateEmail":{"senderEmail":"\"(K18 HCM), Tran Nhat Tan\" <tantnse184055@fpt.edu.vn>","subject":"[INBLUE-APP-96]","bodyText":"","attachmentUrls":"[\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dimvyno0z/image/upload/v1785075156/my_app/docs/28b7ae66-4ac5-4ee5-b07f-111df30c8456.pdf\"]"}},"evaluationCriteria":{"maxScore":100,"aiSystemPrompt":"","extraMetrics":["Closing And Signature","Formatting And Structure","Content And Clarity","Grammar And Vocabulary","General Comment","Salutation And Opening","Strength","Subject Line Quality","Tone And Professionalism","Weakness"]}}', 'EMAIL', null),
