        (207, '{"score": 42, "extraMetrics": {"Subject Line Quality": {"score": 1, "maxScore": 10, "comment": "The subject line ''[INBLUE-APP-125]'' is an internal reference code and critically lacks essential information such as the position applied for and the candidate''s name, making it uninformative and easily overlooked."}, "Salutation And Opening": {"score": 3, "maxScore": 10, "comment": "The salutation ''Kính gửi Ban Tuyển dụng / Anh/Chị [Tên Nhà Tuyển Dụng],'' includes an unedited placeholder, indicating a lack of attention to detail. Furthermore, the opening states an application for a ''Senior'' role with ''4 years experience'', which critically mismatches the ''JUNIOR'' level context provided."}, "Content And Clarity": {"score": 0, "maxScore": 25, "comment": "The content describes a candidate with ''4 years of experience'' applying for a ''Senior UI/UX Designer'' position, which is a critical mismatch with the ''JUNIOR'' level provided in the scenario. Additionally, the email explicitly states ''Tôi đính kèm theo email này CV và Portfolio'' (I have attached my CV and Portfolio), but no attachments were actually included, which is a severe professional error and makes the content misleading."}, "Tone And Professionalism": {"score": 5, "maxScore": 20, "comment": "While the language itself is formal, the fundamental errors of applying for the wrong level, failing to edit the placeholder, and most critically, stating that attachments are included when they are not, demonstrate a severe lack of attention to detail and professionalism regarding the specific application process."}, "Grammar And Vocabulary": {"score": 20, "maxScore": 20, "comment": "Assuming the Vietnamese is correct, the email is grammatically flawless and uses appropriate, professional vocabulary throughout. There are no spelling errors or awkward phrasing."}, "Closing And Signature": {"score": 8, "maxScore": 10, "comment": "The closing is polite and professional. The signature is comprehensiv