e, including all necessary contact information and relevant links, but it implies attachments that are missing."}, "Formatting And Structure": {"score": 5, "maxScore": 5, "comment": "The email is very well-structured, utilizing bullet points effectively for skills, which significantly enhances readability and highlights key information. Paragraphs are logical and flow well."}, "Strength": ["Excellent grammar and professional vocabulary within the written text.", "Well-structured body with clear formatting and use of bullet points.", "Comprehensive and professional signature (despite implying missing attachments)."], "Weakness": ["Critically uninformative subject line.", "Unedited placeholder in the salutation.", "Explicitly states attachments (CV and Portfolio) are included, but none are present.", "Fundamental mismatch between the email''s content (Senior role, 4 years experience) and the provided application level (JUNIOR).", "Demonstrates a severe lack of attention to detail and understanding of the application process."], "General Comment": "This email is critically flawed due to a fundamental mismatch between the candidate''s stated experience/target role and the ''JUNIOR'' level specified in the application context. Combined with missing attachments and an unedited placeholder, this reflects a significant lack of attention to detail and professionalism in the application process."}}', 713, '2026-08-05 20:11:25.173252', 26066, 'java-backend', 'no-trace-id', '{"emailContext":{"scenario":"","level":"JUNIOR","candidateEmail":{"senderEmail":"davidson mcneil <mcneildavidson4970564@gmail.com>","subject":"[INBLUE-APP-129]","bodyText":"Kính gửi Ban Tuyển dụng / Anh/Chị [Tên Nhà Tuyển Dụng],\r\n\r\nTôi tên là *Nguyễn Ngọc Tuấn*, hiện đang làm UI/UX Designer với hơn *4 năm\r\nkinh nghiệm* chuyên sâu trong lĩnh vực thiết kế sản phẩm số (Web & Mobile\r\nApplication). Tôi rất quan tâm và muốn ứng tuyển vị trí *UI/UX Designer\r\n(Senior)* mà quý công ty đang tuyển dụng.\r\n\