email name and signature name.", "Overall unprofessionalism and lack of attention to detail.", "Fails to convey any meaningful information."], "General Comment": "This email is critically unprofessional and incomplete. It appears to be an unedited draft or a placeholder, demonstrating a severe lack of attention to detail and effort, which is unacceptable for any professional communication, especially from an intern."}}', 546, '2026-08-07 10:40:40.283460', 26944, 'java-backend', 'no-trace-id', '{"emailContext":{"scenario":"","level":"INTERN","candidateEmail":{"senderEmail":"\"(K18 HCM), Tran Nhat Tan\" <tantnse184055@fpt.edu.vn>","subject":"[INBLUE-APP-112]","bodyText":"Kính gửi Anh/Chị,\r\n\r\nEm xin phép phản hồi email của Anh/Chị về vấn đề đang xảy ra...\r\n\r\nTrân trọng,\r\nTrần Bình An","attachmentUrls":"[]"}},"evaluationCriteria":{"maxScore":100,"aiSystemPrompt":"","extraMetrics":["Closing And Signature","Formatting And Structure","Content And Clarity","Grammar And Vocabulary","General Comment","Salutation And Opening","Strength","Subject Line Quality","Tone And Professionalism","Weakness"]}}', 'EMAIL', null),
