Tên Nhà Tuyển Dụng],'' includes an unedited placeholder, indicating a lack of attention to detail. Furthermore, the opening states an application for a ''Senior'' role with ''4 years experience'', which critically mismatches the ''JUNIOR'' level context provided., maxScore=10}; Formatting And Structure: {score=5, comment=The email is very well-structured, utilizing bullet points effectively for skills, which significantly enhances readability and highlights key information. Paragraphs are logical and flow well., maxScore=5}; Tone And Professionalism: {score=5, comment=While the language itself is formal, the fundamental errors of applying for the wrong level, failing to edit the placeholder, and most critically, stating that attachments are included when they are not, demonstrate a severe lack of attention to detail and professionalism regarding the specific application process., maxScore=20}","strengths":["Excellent grammar and professional vocabulary within the written text.","Well-structured body with clear formatting and use of bullet points.","Comprehensive and professional signature (despite implying missing attachments)."],"weaknesses":["Critically uninformative subject line.","Unedited placeholder in the salutation.","Explicitly states attachments (CV and Portfolio) are included, but none are present.","Fundamental mismatch between the email''s content (Senior role, 4 years experience) and the provided application level (JUNIOR).","Demonstrates a severe lack of attention to detail and understanding of the application process."],"hrNote":"văn hay chữ tốt","hrScore":50.0},{"roundName":"Quiz","roundType":"QUIZ","roundOrder":3,"score":78.0,"maxScore":100.0,"finalResult":"PASSED","summary":"Correct: 3/4. Topics wrong: What is the correct result of the following code snippet:\n```javascript\nconst a = [1, 2, 3];\nconst b = a;\nb.push(4);\nconsole.log(a.length);\n```","strengths":null,"weaknesses":null,"hrNote":null,"hrScore":null},{"roundName":"Coding","roundType":"CODING","roundOrder":4,"score":83.0,"maxScore":100.0,"finalResult":"PASSED","summary":"Two Sum: pass 5/6 test. Error: RUNTIME_ERROR: Exception in thread \"main\" java.lang.StringIndexOutOfBoundsException: begin 1, end -1, length 0.","strengths":null,"weaknesses":null,"hrNote":null,"hrScore":null},{"roundName":"Code Review","roundType":"CODE_REVIEW","roundOrder":5,"score":100.0,"maxScore":100.0,"finalResult":"PASSED","summary":"Reported issues: 2 (WARNING: 2) | Ứng viên có nền tảng kỹ thuật tốt, phát hiện lỗi nhanh chóng. Tuy nhiên, cần cải thiện tư duy về bảo mật hệ thống (Security Mindset) và khả năng đưa ra giải pháp thực thi thay vì chỉ dừng lại ở mức độ nhận diện vấn đề. | Bug Detection: 9; Missed Issues: Ứng viên đã xác định đúng vị trí lỗi nhưng đánh giá sai mức độ nghiêm trọng (Severity). Cả hai lỗi đều là CRITICAL (lộ thông tin nhạy cảm và lỗ hổng xác thực) nhưng ứng viên chỉ liệt kê là WARNING. Ngoài ra, ứng viên chưa đề xuất giải pháp kỹ thuật cụ thể (code fix) cho các lỗi đã tìm thấy.; Solution Quality: 6; Security Awareness: 6; Clean Code Awareness: 7; Code Smell Detection: 7; Performance Analysis: 5","strengths":["Khả năng đọc hiểu code và xác định chính xác vị trí các lỗ hổng bảo mật tiềm ẩn rất tốt. Ứng viên có tư duy phản biện về luồng dữ liệu và cấu hình hệ thống."],"weaknesses":["Thiếu kinh nghiệm trong việc đánh giá mức độ rủi ro (Risk Assessment) của các lỗ hổng bảo mật. Chưa có kỹ năng đưa ra giải pháp khắc phục (Remediation) cụ thể, điều này rất quan trọng đối với một Senior Engineer."],"hrNote":"","hrScore":100.0},{"roundName":"Mentor Review","roundType":"MENTROR_REVIEW","roundOrder":6,"score":5.0,"maxScore":100.0,"finalResult":"PASSED","summary":"Rating: 5/10 | Situation: gg | Task: gg | Action: gg | Result: gg | Improve: gg","strengths":["gg"],"weaknesses":["gg"],"hrNote":null,"hrScore":null},{"roundName":"AI Interview","roundType":"AI_INTERVIEW","roundOrder":7,"score":3.3,"maxScore":100.0,"finalResult":"REJECT","summary":"Evaluation: REJECT | Answered questions: 13 | Đã chấm điểm xong. | Đã chấm điểm xong. Vui lòng xem chi tiết lịch sử phỏng vấn AI.","strengths":[],"weaknesses":[],"hrNote":null,"hrScore":null}]}}', 'SUMMARY_REPORT', 12.55),
        (266, '{
  "title": "Data Leakage and Injection Vulnerabilities in User API",
  "difficulty": "HARD",
  "language": "TypeScript",
  "problemStatement": "You are reviewing a small Express.js service written in TypeScript that handles user data. The service is intended to provide endpoints for retrieving a user profile and updating a user''s email address. The business requirement is to expose these functionalities to authenticated clients only, protect sensitive information (such as password hashes), and prevent any form of injection attacks. Your task is to identify all security flaws, data leakage points, and unsafe coding practices in the provided source file and suggest concrete remediation steps.",
  "files": [
    {
      "filename": "src/controllers/UserController.ts",
      "language": "typescript",
      "content": "import express from ''express'';\nimport { Request, Response, NextFunction } from ''express'';\nimport db from ''../db'';\nconst router = express.Router();\n// Hardcoded JWT secret (CRITICAL)\nconst JWT_SECRET = ''mySuperSecretKey123'';\n// Middleware that logs request bodies (INFO)\nrouter.use((req: Request, res: Response, next: NextFunction) => {\n  console.log(''Request body:'', req.body);\n  next();\n});\n// Get user profile without authentication (CRITICAL)\nrouter.get(''/profile/:id'', async (req: Request, res: Response) => {\n  const userId = req.params.id;\n  const result = await db.query(`SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ${userId}`);\n  const user = result.rows[0];\n  // Expose password hash in response (CRITICAL)\n  res.json(user);\n});\n// Update user email with unsanitized input (SQL Injection) (CRITICAL)\nrouter.post(''/update-email'', async (req: Request, res: Response) => {\n  const { id, email } = req.body;\n  await db.query(`UPDATE users SET email = ''${email}'' WHERE id = ${id}`);\n  res.send(''Email updated'');\n});\nexport default router;"
    }
  ],
  "expectedIssues": [
    {
      "filename": "src/controllers/UserController.ts",
      "lineNumber": 6,
      "severity": "CRITICAL",
      "description": "Hardcoded JWT secret exposes cryptographic material in source code. An attacker with repository access can forge tokens. Move the secret to environment variables or a secret manager and rotate regularly."
    },
    {
      "filename": "src/controllers/UserController.ts",
      "lineNumber": 9,
      "severity": "INFO",
      "description": "Logging the entire request body may inadvertently record sensitive data (e.g., passwords, personal identifiers) to logs, leading to data leakage. Remove or sanitize logs before writing them."
    },
    {
      "filename": "src/controllers/UserController.ts",
      "lineNumber": 13,
      "severity": "CRITICAL",
      "description": "The ''/profile/:id'' endpoint does not enforce authentication or authorization, allowing any client to retrieve arbitrary user records. Add authentication middleware and verify that the requester is allowed to view the requested profile."
    },
    {
      "filename": "src/controllers/UserController.ts",
      "lineNumber": 18,
      "severity": "CRITICAL",
      "description": "The response returns the full user record, including the password hash, which is a severe data leakage. Filter out sensitive fields before sending the response."
    },
    {
      "filename": "src/controllers/UserController.ts",
      "lineNumber": 15,
      "severity": "CRITICAL",
      "description": "SQL query concatenates the user-supplied ''userId'' directly, creating a SQL injection vector. Use parameterized queries or a query builder to safely bind values."
    },
    {
      "filename": "src/controllers/UserController.ts",
      "lineNumber": 23,
      "severity": "CRITICAL",
      "description": "The email update query interpolates ''email'' and ''id'' directly into the SQL string, enabling SQL injection. Switch to prepared statements or ORM methods that escape inputs."
    }
  ]
}', 2122, '2026-08-10 06:55:33.402391', 959, 'java-code-review', '6a7975da6770830059382720c24ae5fb', '{"topic":"Rò rỉ dữ liệu khi dùng web","difficulty":null,"targetLevel":"Senior","programmingLanguage":"TypeScript","context":{"jobTitle":"Senior","requirement":"Các vấn đề về an ninh mạng","prompting":null}}', 'CODE_REVIEW_GEN', 10.87),
