        (282, '{"score": 83, "extraMetrics": {"Subject Line Quality": {"score": 1, "maxScore": 10, "comment": "The subject line ''[INBLUE-APP-141]'' is an internal reference code and lacks crucial information such as the task name or urgency, making it uninformative for the mentor."}, "Salutation And Opening": {"score": 9, "maxScore": 10, "comment": "The salutation ''Hi Mr. A,'' is appropriate for an intern-mentor relationship. The opening immediately states the task and progress, setting a clear context."}, "Content And Clarity": {"score": 20, "maxScore": 25, "comment": "The email clearly updates on progress, briefly describes the technical blocker (with a placeholder, indicating it''s a template but the intent is clear), and outlines specific troubleshooting steps taken. It effectively communicates the issue and effort without getting overly technical. The request for help is precise (10-15 mins)."}, "Tone And Professionalism": {"score": 18, "maxScore": 20, "comment": "The tone is professional, proactive, and responsible. The intern takes ownership by detailing their attempts to resolve the issue before seeking help and clearly expresses a desire to meet the deadline. The use of a placeholder for the issue is the only minor detractor."}, "Grammar And Vocabulary": {"score": 20, "maxScore": 20, "comment": "The English grammar and vocabulary are excellent, professional, and suitable for the context. There are no spelling errors or awkward phrasing."}, "Closing And Signature": {"score": 10, "maxScore": 10, "comment": "The closing ''Best regards,'' is appropriate. The signature ''Nguyễn Phạm Thu Hà, Java Developer Intern'' is complete and professional."}, "Formatting And Structure": {"score": 5, "maxScore": 5, "comment": "The email is well-structured with clear paragraphs, making it easy to read and understand the progress, blocker, and request."}, "Strength": ["Clear and concise update on task progress and technical blocker.", "Demonstrates proactive problem-solving by listing attempted solutions.", "Professional and responsible tone.", "Specific and reasonable request for mentor''s time (10-15 minutes).", "Excellent grammar, vocabulary, and structure.", "Clear intent to meet the deadline."], "Weakness": ["The subject line is uninformative, which is a missed opportunity for quick context for the mentor.", "Includes a placeholder for the specific issue (''[briefly name issue...])'', which suggests it''s a template rather than a fully customized email."], "General Comment": "This is an excellent email for an intern to send to their mentor. It effectively communicates progress, a clear blocker, and proactive attempts at resolution, while respectfully requesting specific help to stay on track. The only minor points for improvement are the generic subject line and the unedited placeholder for the issue."}}', 627, '2026-08-10 09:22:05.814695', 27199, 'java-backend', 'no-trace-id', '{"emailContext":{"scenario":"Context: You are a Java Developer Intern. You were assigned a basic API task this week with a deadline at the end of the day. During development, you encountered a technical issue that you couldn''t resolve despite spending time researching it.\n\nTask: Write a concise email to your Mentor to:\n- Update them on your task progress.\n- Briefly describe the technical blocker and what you have tried so far.\n- Request 10–15 minutes of their time for support to stay on track.","level":"INTERN","candidateEmail":{"senderEmail":"\"Thu Hà Nguyễn Phạm\" <nha3697@gmail.com>","subject":"[INBLUE-APP-141]","bodyText":"Hi Mr. A,\r\n\r\nI''m working on the assigned API task for today''s deadline and have\r\ncompleted the core endpoint logic and initial unit tests. However, I’ve hit\r\na blocker with [briefly name issue, e.g., an intermittent 500 error during\r\nDB integration / JSON serialization failure].\r\n\r\nTo try to resolve this, I''ve checked the application logs, verified the\r\npayload structure, and researched similar issues on Stack Overflow, but\r\nhaven''t been able to isolate the root cause.\r\n\r\nCould you spare 10–15 minutes today to take a quick look with me? I want to\r\nmake sure I get this resolved and stay on track for the end-of-day deadline.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n\r\nNguyễn Phạm Thu Hà\r\n\r\nJava Developer Intern","attachmentUrls":"[]"}},"evaluationCriteria":{"maxScore":100,"aiSystemPrompt":"","extraMetrics":["Closing And Signature","Formatting And Structure","Content And Clarity","Grammar And Vocabulary","General Comment","Salutation And Opening","Strength","Subject Line Quality","Tone And Professionalism","Weakness"]}}', 'EMAIL', 12.34),
