        (360, '{"score": 70, "extraMetrics": {"Subject Line Quality": {"score": 1, "maxScore": 10, "comment": "The subject line ''[INBLUE-APP-173]'' is an internal reference code and fails to provide context about the email''s purpose, making it uninformative for the recipient."}, "Salutation And Opening": {"score": 9, "maxScore": 10, "comment": "The salutation ''Kính gửi chị Sarah,'' is appropriate. The opening effectively acknowledges the issue and its impact, setting a positive and receptive tone."}, "Content And Clarity": {"score": 15, "maxScore": 25, "comment": "The email clearly outlines both immediate and long-term solutions without being overly technical. It also offers further support. However, the signature indicates ''Head of Customer Service'' while the candidate is ''JUNIOR'', which is a significant role mismatch. Additionally, it implies an access link was sent ''qua email quản trị'' but no such link is provided in this email, which is a detail oversight."}, "Tone And Professionalism": {"score": 12, "maxScore": 20, "comment": "The tone is professional, apologetic, and solution-oriented. However, the discrepancy between the candidate''s ''JUNIOR'' level and the ''Head of Customer Service'' title in the signature is a critical professional inconsistency."}, "Grammar And Vocabulary": {"score": 20, "maxScore": 20, "comment": "The Vietnamese used is grammatically correct and employs appropriate, professional vocabulary throughout the email."}, "Closing And Signature": {"score": 8, "maxScore": 10, "comment": "The closing ''Trân trọng,'' is polite. The signature includes the candidate''s name and a functional title, but the title ''Trưởng bộ phận Chăm sóc Khách hàng'' (Head of Customer Service) contradicts the ''JUNIOR'' level of the candidate."}, "Formatting And Structure": {"score": 5, "maxScore": 5, "comment": "The email is well-structured with clear paragraphs and bullet points, enhancing readability."}, "Strength": ["Clear and concise communication of immediate and long-term solutions.", "Proactive in offering further direct support.", "Polite, apologetic, and solution-oriented tone.", "Excellent grammar, vocabulary, and clear structure."], "Weakness": ["Uninformative subject line.", "Significant role mismatch in the signature (Junior candidate signing as Head of Customer Service).", "Implies an access link was sent externally, but no direct link or reference is provided within this email.", "The professional title used in the signature is inconsistent with the candidate''s ''JUNIOR'' level."], "General Comment": "This email effectively communicates solutions for a service interruption with clarity and a professional tone. However, the uninformative subject line, the implied missing access details, and the critical mismatch between the candidate''s ''JUNIOR'' level and the ''Head of Customer Service'' signature are significant professional oversights."}}', 646, '2026-08-15 14:24:00.180988', 27375, 'java-backend', 'no-trace-id', '{"emailContext":{"scenario":"","level":"JUNIOR","candidateEmail":{"senderEmail":"\"Thu Hà Nguyễn Phạm\" <nha3697@gmail.com>","subject":"[INBLUE-APP-173]","bodyText":"Kính gửi chị Sarah,\r\n\r\nCảm ơn chị đã phản hồi. Chúng tôi rất xin lỗi vì sự cố gián đoạn đăng nhập\r\nsáng nay đã làm ảnh hưởng đến công việc của bên mình.\r\n\r\nĐội ngũ kỹ thuật đã kiểm tra nguyên nhân và triển khai các phương án xử lý\r\nnhư sau:\r\n\r\n   1.\r\n\r\n   *Giải pháp tức thì:*\r\n   -\r\n\r\n      Chúng tôi đã cấp quyền truy cập trực tiếp tạm thời để toàn bộ nhân sự\r\n      bên chị có thể tiếp tục công việc ngay bây giờ.\r\n      2.\r\n\r\n   *Giải pháp triệt để:*\r\n   -\r\n\r\n      Bản cập nhật sửa lỗi hoàn toàn sẽ được chạy vào 22:00 tối nay. Hoạt\r\n      động của hệ thống sẽ không bị gián đoạn trong lúc cập nhật.\r\n\r\nChị vui lòng kiểm tra lại đường dẫn truy cập đã gửi qua email quản trị. Nếu\r\ncần hỗ trợ thêm, em luôn sẵn sàng gọi điện hỗ trợ trực tiếp.\r\n\r\nTrân trọng,\r\n\r\n*Nguyễn Phạm Thu Hà*\r\n\r\nTrưởng bộ phận Chăm sóc Khách hàng","attachmentUrls":"[]"}},"evaluationCriteria":{"maxScore":100,"aiSystemPrompt":"","extraMetrics":["Closing And Signature","Formatting And Structure","Content And Clarity","Grammar And Vocabulary","General Comment","Salutation And Opening","Strength","Subject Line Quality","Tone And Professionalism","Weakness"]}}', 'EMAIL', 21.05),
